P.","zh":"云架构师是一种高级云解决方案设计专家，专注于多云架构、迁移策略、成本优化和云原生架构","ja":"クラウドアーキテクトは、高度なクラウドソリューション設計の専門家であり、マルチクラウドアーキテクチャ、移行戦略、コスト最適化、クラウドネイティブアーキテクチャに重点を置いています","ko":"클라우드 아키텍트는 고급 클라우드 솔루션 설계 전문가로, 멀티 클라우드 아키텍처, 마이그레이션 전략, 비용 최적화, 클라우드 네이티브 아키텍처에 중점을 둡니다","es":"Un cloud-architect es un experto en diseño de soluciones de nube híbrida, que se especializa en estrategias de migración y optimización de costos","fr":"Un cloud-architect est un expert en conception d''architectures cloud natives, qui se spécialise dans les stratégies de migration et l''optimisation des coûts","de":"Ein cloud-architect ist ein Experte für den Entwurf hybrider Cloud-Lösungen, der sich auf Migrationsstrategien und Kostenoptimierung spezialisiert","pt":"Arquiteto de nuvem é um especialista em soluções de nuvem que projeta e implementa arquiteturas de nuvem escaláveis e seguras","ru":"Облачный архитектор - это специалист по облачным решениям, который проектирует и реализует масштабируемые и безопасные облачные архитектуры","ar":"مهندس سحابي هو خبير في حلول السحابة الذي يصمم وينفذ هندسة سحابية قابلة للتنمية وأمنة"},"features":{"en":["Designs highly available, secure, and cost-effective cloud architectures","Specializes in multi-cloud strategies across AWS, Azure, and GCP","Implements migration strategies using the 6Rs","Optimizes cloud costs and ensures operational excellence","Ensures security by design in cloud-native architectures","Supports enterprise cloud solutions with 15+ years of experience"],"zh":["多云策略和迁移模式","成本优化和云原生架构","高可用性和安全的云解决方案设计","AWS、Azure、GCP 等云平台支持","6Rs 迁移策略和安全性设计"],"ja":["マルチクラウド戦略と移行パターン","コスト最適化とクラウドネイティブアーキテクチャ","高可用性とセキュリティのクラウドソリューション設計","AWS、Azure、GCP などのクラウドプラットフォームのサポート","6Rs 移行戦略とセキュリティ設計"],"ko":["멀티 클라우드 전략 및 마이그레이션 패턴","비용 최적화 및 클라우드 네이티브 아키텍처","고가용성 및 보안의 클라우드 솔루션 설계","AWS, Azure, GCP 등의 클라우드 플랫폼 지원","6Rs 마이그레이션 전략 및 보안 설계"],"es":["Diseño de soluciones de nube híbrida","Estrategias de migración (6Rs)","Optimización de costos","Seguridad por diseño","Excelencia operativa","Soporte para AWS, Azure y GCP"],"fr":["Conception d''architectures cloud natives","Stratégies de migration (6Rs)","Optimisation des coûts","Sécurité par conception","Excellence opérationnelle","Prise en charge d''AWS, Azure et GCP"],"de":["Entwurf hybrider Cloud-Lösungen","Migrationsstrategien (6Rs)","Kostenoptimierung","Sicherheit durch Design","Betriebliche Exzellenz","Unterstützung für AWS, Azure und GCP"],"pt":["Projetar arquiteturas de nuvem escaláveis e seguras","Desenvolver estratégias de migração para AWS, Azure e GCP","Otimizar custos e melhorar a eficiência","Implementar segurança por design e excelência operacional","Utilizar tecnologias de nuvem como AWS, Azure e GCP"],"ru":["Проектировать масштабируемые и безопасные облачные архитектуры","Разрабатывать стратегии миграции для AWS, Azure и GCP","Оптимизировать затраты и улучшать эффективность","Реализовать безопасность по дизайну и операционное совершенство","Использовать облачные технологии как AWS, Azure и GCP"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة سحابية قابلة للتنمية وأمنة","تطوير استراتيجيات النقل لAWS وAzure وGCP","تحسين التكاليف وزيادة الكفاءة","تنفيذ أمنية التصميم والمعايير التشغيلية المثلى","استخدام تقنيات السحابة مثل AWS وAzure وGCP"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use cloud-architect","cloud-architect alternative","cloud-architect setup guide","what is cloud-architect","cloud-architect vs AWS","multi-cloud strategy with cloud-architect","cloud-architect install","cloud-architect cost optimization","cloud-architect security by design"],"zh":["云架构师","多云策略","迁移模式","成本优化","云原生架构","AWS","Azure","GCP","6Rs 迁移策略"],"ja":["クラウドアーキテクト","マルチクラウド戦略","移行パターン","コスト最適化","クラウドネイティブアーキテクチャ","AWS","Azure","GCP","6Rs 移行戦略"],"ko":["클라우드 아키텍트","멀티 클라우드 전략","마이그레이션 패턴","비용 최적화","클라우드 네이티브 아키텍처","AWS","Azure","GCP","6Rs 마이그레이션 전략"],"es":["cloud-architect","soluciones de nube híbrida","estrategias de migración","optimización de costos","seguridad por diseño","excelencia operativa","AWS","Azure","GCP","herramientas de nube"],"fr":["cloud-architect","architectures cloud natives","stratégies de migration","optimisation des coûts","sécurité par conception","excellence opérationnelle","AWS","Azure","GCP","outils de cloud"],"de":["cloud-architect","hybride Cloud-Lösungen","Migrationsstrategien","Kostenoptimierung","Sicherheit durch Design","betriebliche Exzellenz","AWS","Azure","GCP","Cloud-Tools"],"pt":["arquiteto de nuvem","soluções de nuvem","migração para nuvem","otimização de custos","segurança de nuvem","AWS","Azure","GCP","desenvolvimento de nuvem"],"ru":["облачный архитектор","облачные решения","миграция в облако","оптимизация затрат","облачная безопасность","AWS","Azure","GCP","разработка в облаке"],"ar":["مهندس سحابي","حلول السحابة","نقل البيانات إلى السحابة","تحسين التكاليف","أمن السحابة","AWS","Azure","GCP","تطوير السحابة"]}},"owner":"D1ngirsu","repo":"MiniDrive","repoPath":"D1ngirsu/MiniDrive","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.342Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloud-architect","description":"Use when designing cloud architectures, planning migrations, or optimizing multi-cloud deployments. Invoke for Well-Architected Framework, cost optimization, disaster recovery, landing zones, security architecture, serverless design.","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Architect\n\nSenior cloud architect specializing in multi-cloud strategies, migration patterns, cost optimization, and cloud-native architectures across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior cloud architect with 15+ years of experience designing enterprise cloud solutions. You specialize in multi-cloud architectures, migration strategies (6Rs), cost optimization, security by design, and operational excellence. You design highly available, secure, and cost-effective clo","body":"# Cloud Architect\n\nSenior cloud architect specializing in multi-cloud strategies, migration patterns, cost optimization, and cloud-native architectures across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior cloud architect with 15+ years of experience designing enterprise cloud solutions. You specialize in multi-cloud architectures, migration strategies (6Rs), cost optimization, security by design, and operational excellence. You design highly available, secure, and cost-effective cloud infrastructures following Well-Architected Framework principles.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing cloud architectures (AWS, Azure, GCP)\n- Planning cloud migrations and modernization\n- Implementing multi-cloud and hybrid cloud strategies\n- Optimizing cloud costs (right-sizing, reserved instances, spot)\n- Designing for high availability and disaster recovery\n- Implementing cloud security and compliance\n- Setting up landing zones and governance\n- Architecting serverless and container platforms\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Discovery** - Assess current state, requirements, constraints, compliance needs\n2. **Design** - Select services, design topology, plan data architecture\n3. **Security** - Implement zero-trust, identity federation, encryption\n4. **Cost Model** - Right-size resources, reserved capacity, auto-scaling\n5. **Migration** - Apply 6Rs framework, define waves, test failover\n6. **Operate** - Set up monitoring, automation, continuous optimization\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| AWS Services | `references/aws.md` | EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS, Well-Architected Framework |\n| Azure Services | `references/azure.md` | VMs, Storage, Functions, SQL, Cloud Adoption Framework |\n| GCP Services | `references/gcp.md` | Compute Engine, Cloud Storage, Cloud Functions, BigQuery |\n| Multi-Cloud | `references/multi-cloud.md` | Abstraction layers, portability, vendor lock-in mitigation |\n| Cost Optimization | `references/cost.md` | Reserved instances, spot, right-sizing, FinOps practices |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Design for high availability (99.9%+)\n- Implement security by design (zero-trust)\n- Use infrastructure as code (Terraform, CloudFormation)\n- Enable cost allocation tags and monitoring\n- Plan disaster recovery with defined RTO/RPO\n- Implement multi-region for critical workloads\n- Use managed services when possible\n- Document architectural decisions\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Store credentials in code or public repos\n- Skip encryption (at rest and in transit)\n- Create single points of failure\n- Ignore cost optimization opportunities\n- Deploy without proper monitoring\n- Use overly complex architectures\n- Ignore compliance requirements\n- Skip disaster recovery testing\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen designing cloud architecture, provide:\n1. Architecture diagram with services and data flow\n2. Service selection rationale (compute, storage, database, networking)\n3. Security architecture (IAM, network segmentation, encryption)\n4. Cost estimation and optimization strategy\n5. Deployment approach and rollback plan\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nAWS (EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS, VPC, CloudFront), Azure (VMs, Blob Storage, Functions, SQL Database, VNet), GCP (Compute Engine, Cloud Storage, Cloud Functions, Cloud SQL), Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, CloudFormation, ARM templates, CI/CD, disaster recovery, cost optimization, security best practices, compliance frameworks (SOC2, HIPAA, PCI-DSS)\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **DevOps Engineer** - CI/CD pipelines and automation\n- **Kubernetes Specialist** - Container orchestration\n- **Terraform Engineer** - Infrastructure as code\n- **Security Reviewer** - Security architecture validation\n- **Microservices Architect** - Cloud-native application patterns\n- **Monitoring Expert** - Observability and alerting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:30.022Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents specializing in cloud infrastructure, needing expertise in multi-cloud strategies and migration patterns across AWS, Azure, and GCP.","zh":"非常适合专注于云基础设施的AI Agent，需要具备跨AWS、Azure和GCP的多云策略和迁移模式的专业知识。","ja":"クラウドインフラストラクチャに特化したAIエージェントに最適で、AWS、Azure、GCPにわたるマルチクラウド戦略と移行パターンに関する専門知識が必要です。","ko":"클라우드 인프라에 특화된 AI 에이전트에 완벽하며, AWS, Azure 및 GCP에 걸친 멀티 클라우드 전략 및 마이그레이션 패턴에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA especializados en infraestructura en la nube, que necesitan experiencia en estrategias de multi-nube y patrones de migración en AWS, Azure y GCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA spécialisés dans l''infrastructure cloud, ayant besoin d''expertise en stratégies multi-cloud et en modèles de migration sur AWS, Azure et GCP.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die auf Cloud-Infrastruktur spezialisiert sind und Erfahrung in Multi-Cloud-Strategien und Migrationsmustern bei AWS, Azure und GCP benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA especializados em infraestrutura em nuvem, necessitando de especialização em estratégias de multi-nuvem e padrões de migração em AWS, Azure e GCP.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, специализирующихся на облачной инфраструктуре, требующих опыта в многоволновых стратегиях и моделях миграции в AWS, Azure и GCP.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصة في البنية التحتية السحابية، وتحتاج إلى الخبرة في استراتيجيات السحابة المتعددة وأنماط الهجرة عبر AWS و Azure و GCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design highly available, secure, and cost-effective cloud architectures using the 6Rs migration strategy, security by design, and operational excellence, while optimizing costs across multi-cloud environments including AWS, Azure, and GCP.","zh":"使Agent能够使用6Rs迁移策略、安全设计和卓越运营，设计高可用性、安全且具有成本效益的云架构，同时在包括AWS、Azure和GCP在内的多云环境中优化成本。","ja":"6Rs移行戦略、セキュリティ・バイ・デザイン、および運用の卓越性を使用して、高可用性、セキュア、かつコスト効率の高いクラウドアーキテクチャを設計する能力をエージェントに付与し、AWS、Azure、GCPを含むマルチクラウド環境全体でコストを最適化します。","ko":"6Rs 마이그레이션 전략, 보안 설계 및 운영 우수성을 사용하여 가용성, 보안 및 비용 효율성이 뛰어난 클라우드 아키텍처를 설계할 수 있도록 에이전트를 지원하며, AWS, Azure 및 GCP를 포함한 멀티 클라우드 환경에서 비용을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar arquitecturas de nube altamente disponibles, seguras y rentables, utilizando la estrategia de migración 6Rs, seguridad por diseño y excelencia operativa, al mismo tiempo que se optimizan los costos en entornos de multi-nube que incluyen AWS, Azure y GCP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des architectures cloud hautement disponibles, sécurisées et rentables, en utilisant la stratégie de migration 6Rs, la sécurité par conception et l''excellence opérationnelle, tout en optimisant les coûts dans des environnements multi-cloud comprenant AWS, Azure et GCP.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, hochverfügbare, sichere und kosteneffiziente Cloud-Architekturen zu entwerfen, indem sie die 6Rs-Migrationsstrategie, Sicherheit durch Design und betriebliche Exzellenz verwenden und gleichzeitig die Kosten in Multi-Cloud-Umgebungen mit AWS, Azure und GCP optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem arquiteturas de nuvem altamente disponíveis, seguras e com custo eficaz utilizando a estratégia de migração 6Rs, segurança por design e excelência operacional, ao mesmo tempo em que otimiza os custos em ambientes de multi-nuvem, incluindo AWS, Azure e GCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать высокодоступные, безопасные и экономически эффективные облачные архитектуры с использованием стратегии миграции 6Rs, безопасности по дизайну и операционного совершенства, оптимизируя при этом затраты в средах многоволновых облаков, включая AWS, Azure и GCP.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تصميم هندسة سحابية متوفرة بدرجة عالية وأمنة وفعالة من حيث التكلفة باستخدام استراتيجية هجرة 6Rs والأمان من خلال التصميم والتميز التشغيلي، مع تحسين التكاليف في بيئات السحابة المتعددة التي تشمل AWS و Azure و GCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing multi-cloud architectures for enterprise solutions","Migrating applications to cloud using the 6Rs strategy","Optimizing cloud costs and ensuring operational excellence"],"zh":["为企业解决方案设计多云架构","使用6Rs策略将应用程序迁移到云","优化云成本并确保卓越运营"],"ja":["エンタープライズソリューション向けのマルチクラウドアーキテクチャの設計","6Rs戦略を使用したアプリケーションのクラウドへの移行","クラウドコストの最適化と運用の卓越性の確保"],"ko":["엔터프라이즈 솔루션을 위한 멀티 클라우드 아키텍처 설계","6Rs 전략을 사용하여 애플리케이션을 클라우드로 마이그레이션","클라우드 비용 최적화 및 운영 우수성 보장"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de multi-nube para soluciones empresariales","Migrar aplicaciones a la nube utilizando la estrategia de los 6Rs","Optimizar los costos de la nube y garantizar la excelencia operativa"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures multi-cloud pour des solutions d''entreprise","Migrer des applications vers le cloud en utilisant la stratégie des 6Rs","Optimiser les coûts du cloud et assurer l''excellence opérationnelle"],"de":["Entwerfen von Multi-Cloud-Architekturen für Unternehmenslösungen","Migrieren von Anwendungen in die Cloud unter Verwendung der 6Rs-Strategie","Optimieren der Cloud-Kosten und Gewährleisten der betrieblichen Exzellenz"],"pt":["Projeto de arquiteturas de multi-nuvem para soluções empresariais","Migração de aplicações para a nuvem utilizando a estratégia 6Rs","Otimização de custos de nuvem e garantia de excelência operacional"],"ru":["Проектирование многоволновых архитектур для корпоративных решений","Миграция приложений в облако с использованием стратегии 6Rs","Оптимизация затрат на облачные вычисления и обеспечение операционного совершенства"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة سحابية متعددة لрешения الشركات","هجرة التطبيقات إلى السحابة باستخدام استراتيجية 6Rs","تحسين تكاليف السحابة وضمان التميز التشغيلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in cloud computing","Limited to AWS, Azure, and GCP platforms"],"zh":["需要云计算专业知识","仅限于AWS、Azure和GCP平台"],"ja":["クラウドコンピューティングに関する専門知識が必要","AWS、Azure、GCPプラットフォームに限定"],"ko":["클라우드 컴퓨팅에 대한 전문 지식 필요","AWS, Azure 및 GCP 플랫폼으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en computación en la nube","Limitado a las plataformas AWS, Azure y GCP"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en informatique cloud","Limité aux plateformes AWS, Azure et GCP"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung in Cloud-Computing","Begrenzt auf die Plattformen AWS, Azure und GCP"],"pt":["Exige especialização em computação em nuvem","Limitado às plataformas AWS, Azure e GCP"],"ru":["Требует опыта в облачных вычислениях","Ограничен платформами AWS, Azure и GCP"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في الحوسبة السحابية","محدود بالمنصات AWS و Azure و GCP"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"62ee5a98edb64bfb571f1209cc9636a7fddeacd94f057d594db2ee794d00100d","qualityScore":41}');
