example extractor AI工具 库框架查找 API查找 代码示例 配置查找 文档查找 Context7 web.run Resolves library ID using Context7 Fetches targeted documentation using web.run with search_query Extracts APIs, examples, configuration, and pitfalls from official docs Provides library name and version information Offers code examples and short API reference lists Includes URLs for official documentation explore-docs is a skill that provides library details, including API references, code examples, and official documentation URLs.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('flet-dev/flet/implement-flet-extension', 'community', 'flet-dev', 'flet', 'flet-dev/flet', 'implement-flet-extension', 0, 0, 41, '2026-03-08T01:57:15.376Z', '2026-03-08T02:05:48.131Z', 'd8e77695ce90118a51c5be7399fb767a2b745842f1f665fa10426c74fbf54622', '{"id":"flet-dev/flet/implement-flet-extension","name":"implement-flet-extension","description":{"en":"The implement-flet-extension skill enables developers to build real-time web, mobile, and desktop apps in Python, using Flet and external Flutter packages. It benefits developers without frontend experience.","zh":"Flet 扩展允许开发人员使用 Python 构建实时 Web、移动和桌面应用，无需前端经验","ja":"Flet 拡張を使用すると、開発者は Python を使用してリアルタイム Web、モバイル、デスクトップ アプリを構築できます。前端の経験は必要ありません","ko":"Flet 확장을 사용하면 개발자가 Python을 사용하여 실시간 웹, 모바일, 데스크톱 앱을 빌드할 수 있습니다. 프론트엔드 경험은 필요하지 않습니다","es":"La extensión Flet permite a los desarrolladores crear aplicaciones web, móviles y de escritorio en tiempo real con Python, sin necesidad de experiencia en frontend.","fr":"L''extension Flet permet aux développeurs de créer des applications web, mobiles et de bureau en temps réel avec Python, sans nécessité d''expérience en frontend.","de":"Die Flet-Erweiterung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Echtzeit-Web-, Mobile- und Desktop-Anwendungen mit Python zu erstellen, ohne dass Frontend-Erfahrung erforderlich ist.","pt":"O Flet-Extension permite que desenvolvedores criem aplicações em Python sem experiência em frontend. Aprenda a implementá-lo","ru":"Flet-Extension позволяет разработчикам создавать приложения на Python без опыта в frontend. Узнайте, как реализовать","ar":"ملحق Flet يسمح للمطورين ببناء تطبيقات في بيثون بدون خبرة في واجهة المستخدم. تعلم كيفية التنفيذ"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"implement-flet-extension: Flet Extension Setup Guide | AI...","zh":"Flet 扩展实现指南 - 使用 Python 构建实时应用","ja":"Flet 拡張の実装方法 - Python でリアルタイムアプリを構築","ko":"Flet 확장 구현 가이드 - Python을 사용한 실시간 앱 빌드","es":"Implementar extensión Flet: Guía de configuración para de...","fr":"Mettre en œuvre l''extension Flet : Guide de démarrage pou...","de":"Flet-Erweiterung implementieren: Einrichtungsleitfaden fü...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Implement-Flet-Extension para Des...","ru":"Руководство по реализации Flet-Extension для разработчико...","ar":"دليل تنفيذ ملحق Flet لتطوير التطبيقات في بيثون"},"description":{"en":"Learn how to implement Flet extensions with Python, leveraging existing flet_* packages and Flutter integration - get started now!","zh":"学习如何使用 Flet 扩展构建实时 Web、移动和桌面应用，使用 Python 编程语言，无需前端经验","ja":"Flet 拡張を使用してリアルタイム Web、モバイル、デスクトップ アプリを構築する方法を学びます。Python プログラミング言語を使用し、前端の経験は必要ありません","ko":"Flet 확장을 사용하여 실시간 웹, 모바일, 데스크톱 앱을 구축하는 방법을 알아보세요. Python 프로그래밍 언어를 사용하고, 프론트엔드 경험은 필요하지 않습니다","es":"Aprende a implementar una extensión Flet alrededor de un paquete Flutter externo con nuestros ejemplos de código y plantillas","fr":"Découvrez comment mettre en œuvre une extension Flet autour d''un paquet Flutter externe avec nos exemples de code et modèles","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie eine Flet-Erweiterung um ein externes Flutter-Paket herum implementieren, mit unseren Codebeispielen und Vorlagen","pt":"Aprenda a implementar o Flet-Extension para criar aplicações web, mobile e desktop em Python sem experiência em frontend","ru":"Узнайте, как реализовать Flet-Extension для создания реальных веб-, мобильных и桌товых приложений на Python с помощью ИИ Агентов","ar":"اكتشف كيفية تنفيذ ملحق Flet لبناء تطبيقات الويب والموبايل والesktop في بيثون بدون خبرة في واجهة المستخدم"},"definition":{"en":"implement-flet-extension is a skill that allows developers to create Flet extensions around external Flutter packages using Python","zh":"Flet 扩展是一种使用 Python 构建实时应用的工具","ja":"Flet 拡張は、Python を使用してリアルタイム アプリを構築するツールです","ko":"Flet 확장은 Python을 사용하여 실시간 앱을 구축하는 도구입니다","es":"La implementación de la extensión Flet es el proceso de crear una extensión alrededor de un paquete Flutter externo","fr":"La mise en œuvre de l''extension Flet est le processus de création d''une extension autour d''un paquet Flutter externe","de":"Die Implementierung der Flet-Erweiterung ist der Prozess der Erstellung einer Erweiterung um ein externes Flutter-Paket herum","pt":"O que é Flet-Extension? É uma ferramenta para criar aplicações web, mobile e desktop em Python","ru":"Что такое Flet-Extension? Это инструмент для создания реальных веб-, мобильных и桌товых приложений на Python","ar":"ما هو ملحق Flet؟ هو أداة لبناء تطبيقات الويب والموبايل والesktop في بيثون"},"features":{"en":["Implements Flet extensions using existing flet_* packages as templates","Integrates with external Flutter packages from pub.dev","Supports API surface exposure in Python, including properties, methods, and events","Confirms package health through maintenance activity and null-safety checks","Ensures license compatibility for seamless integration"],"zh":["使用 Flet 扩展构建实时 Web、移动和桌面应用","无需前端经验即可使用 Python 构建应用","支持使用现有的 flet_* 包作为实现模板","可以确认包的健康状况和许可兼容性","可以将 API 表面暴露在 Python 中","支持使用目标 pub.dev 包和版本范围"],"ja":["Flet 拡張を使用してリアルタイム Web、モバイル、デスクトップ アプリを構築","前端の経験がなくても Python を使用してアプリを構築できます","既存の flet_* パッケージを実装テンプレートとして使用することができます","パッケージの健全性とライセンスの互換性を確認できます","API サーフェスを Python で公開できます","対象の pub.dev パッケージとバージョン範囲を使用することができます"],"ko":["Flet 확장을 사용하여 실시간 웹, 모바일, 데스크톱 앱을 구축","프론트엔드 경험 없이 Python을 사용하여 앱을 빌드할 수 있습니다","기존의 flet_* 패키지를 구현 템플릿으로 사용할 수 있습니다","패키지의 건강 상태와 라이선스 호환성을 확인할 수 있습니다","API 표면을 Python에서 노출할 수 있습니다","대상 pub.dev 패키지와 버전 범위를 사용할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Implementación de una extensión Flet alrededor de un paquete Flutter externo","Uso de plantillas de código existentes para implementar la extensión","Compatibilidad con diferentes versiones de paquetes","Análisis de la salud del paquete y riesgos de problemas","Soporte para tipos, enumeraciones y eventos de Python"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''une extension Flet autour d''un paquet Flutter externe","Utilisation de modèles de code existants pour implémenter l''extension","Compatibilité avec différentes versions de paquets","Analyse de la santé du paquet et des risques de problèmes","Prise en charge des types, énumérations et événements Python"],"de":["Implementierung einer Flet-Erweiterung um ein externes Flutter-Paket herum","Verwendung von Vorlagen für die Implementierung der Erweiterung","Unterstützung für verschiedene Paketversionen","Analyse der Paketgesundheit und Risiken von Problemen","Unterstützung für Python-Typen, -Aufzählungen und -Ereignisse"],"pt":["Crie aplicações web, mobile e desktop em Python","Não requer experiência em frontend","Utiliza pacotes existentes como templates de implementação","Suporta API surface para exposição em Python","Verifica a saúde do pacote e a licença"],"ru":["Создайте реальные веб-, мобильные и桌товые приложения на Python","Не требует опыта в frontend","Использует существующие пакеты как шаблоны реализации","Поддерживает API surface для экспозиции в Python","Проверяет здоровье пакета и лицензию"],"ar":["ابني تطبيقات الويب والموبايل والesktop في بيثون","لا يتطلب خبرة في واجهة المستخدم","يستخدم الحزم الموجودة كقوالب تنفيذ","يدعم سطح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للاستخدام في بيثون","يفحص صحة الحزمة والترخيص"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use implement-flet-extension","what is implement-flet-extension","implement-flet-extension alternative","implement-flet-extension vs Flutter","implement-flet-extension install","implement-flet-extension setup guide","Flet extension development","Python Flutter integration","real-time web app development"],"zh":["Flet 扩展","Python 实时应用","无需前端经验","flet_* 包","包健康状况","许可兼容性","API 表面","pub.dev 包","版本范围"],"ja":["Flet 拡張","Python リアルタイムアプリ","前端の経験不要","flet_* パッケージ","パッケージの健全性","ライセンスの互換性","API サーフェス","pub.dev パッケージ","バージョン範囲"],"ko":["Flet 확장","Python 실시간 앱","프론트엔드 경험 필요하지 않음","flet_* 패키지","패키지 건강 상태","라이선스 호환성","API 표면","pub.dev 패키지","버전 범위"],"es":["implementar extensión Flet","desarrollo de aplicaciones en tiempo real","paquetes Flutter","Python para desarrolladores","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","integración de paquetes externos"],"fr":["mettre en œuvre l''extension Flet","développement d''applications en temps réel","paquets Flutter","Python pour les développeurs","outils d''AI pour les développeurs","intégration de paquets externes"],"de":["Flet-Erweiterung implementieren","Entwicklung von Echtzeit-Anwendungen","Flutter-Pakete","Python für Entwickler","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Integration externer Pakete"],"pt":["Flet-Extension","desenvolvimento de aplicações em Python","criação de aplicações web","criação de aplicações mobile","criação de aplicações desktop","Python para desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento em Python"],"ru":["Flet-Extension","разработка приложений на Python","создание веб-приложений","создание мобильных приложений","создание桌товых приложений","Python для разработчиков","инструменты разработки на Python","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["ملحق Flet","تطوير التطبيقات في بيثون","بناء تطبيقات الويب","بناء تطبيقات الموبايل","بناء تطبيقات الesktop","بيثون للمطورين","أدوات التطوير في بيثون","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"flet-dev","repo":"flet","repoPath":"flet-dev/flet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.376Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implement-flet-extension","description":"Implement a new Flet extension/control that wraps a third-party Flutter package end-to-end, including dependency selection, version pinning, compatibility checks, Python/Flutter integration, docs, examples, tests, and CI updates. Use when adding any flet_* package backed by an external pub.dev package.","bodyPreview":"Implement a Flet extension around an external Flutter package using existing `flet_*` packages as implementation templates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Control/service name and Python package name (`flet_<extension>`).\n- Target pub.dev package and intended version/range.\n- API surface to expose in Python (properties, methods, events, types/enums).\n\n## Third-party Dependency Gate\n\n1. Confirm package health: maintenance activity, null-safety, platform support, and open issue risk.\n2. Confirm license is compatib","body":"Implement a Flet extension around an external Flutter package using existing `flet_*` packages as implementation templates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Control/service name and Python package name (`flet_<extension>`).\n- Target pub.dev package and intended version/range.\n- API surface to expose in Python (properties, methods, events, types/enums).\n\n## Third-party Dependency Gate\n\n1. Confirm package health: maintenance activity, null-safety, platform support, and open issue risk.\n2. Confirm license is compatible with Flet distribution.\n3. Select a conservative version strategy:\n- Pin exact version when behavior stability is critical.\n- Use bounded ranges when required by ecosystem constraints.\n4. Record key constraints and reasons in PR notes/commit message.\n\n## Control/Service Classification\n\n- Classify wrapped functionality before implementation:\n1. `LayoutControl` for visual controls that participate in page/layout positioning.\n2. Base `Control` for simple visual controls that do not require page positioning or define their own positioning rules/props (for example `Draggable`, `Divider`, `MenuBar`, `NavigationRail`).\n3. Non-visual Service when functionality is not a renderable UI control.\n- Inspect the wrapped Flutter package API to determine whether it includes non-visual/service functionality.\n- For service patterns, follow existing extension examples: `sdk/python/packages/flet-audio`, `sdk/python/packages/flet-flashlight`, `sdk/python/packages/flet-secure-storage`.\n\n## API Mapping Rules\n\n- Expose only stable and useful features first; avoid mirroring every upstream option.\n- Keep Python API idiomatic and concise; avoid redundant control-name prefixes.\n- Map upstream naming inconsistencies to Flet conventions when needed.\n- Add custom enums/types only when they improve correctness and discoverability.\n\n## Python-side Rules\n\n- Use `LayoutControl`, base `Control`, or Service base class according to classification.\n- Implement typed properties, methods, and events exactly for chosen public API.\n- Reuse existing serialization/event patterns from sibling controls/services.\n\n## Flutter-side Rules\n\n- Use `parseEnum()` for enums.\n- For control attributes, prefer `widget.control.getBool()/getDouble()/...` accessors.\n- For non-control parsing, use shared `parseSomething()` helpers.\n- Do not add one-off private parser utilities when standard helpers exist.\n- Put control-specific helpers in `utils/<control>.dart`; shared helpers in `utils/<topic>.dart`.\n- Prefer `parse`-prefixed helper names when converting input to Flutter structures.\n- Avoid single-use local variables.\n\n## Integration Checklist\n\n- Add dependency and registration to Flet client app.\n- Add extension package to `sdk/python/pyproject.toml`.\n- Add extension to `sdk/python/packages/flet/pyproject.toml`.\n- Add extension to `sdk/python/examples/apps/flet_build_test/pyproject.toml`.\n- Add extension to `.github/workflows/ci.yml` in both places:\n  - `build_flet_extensions` -> `PACKAGES` list.\n  - `py_publish` -> `for pkg in ...` publish loop.\n- Add `.gitignore` to Flutter extension project if missing.\n\n## Docs, Examples, Tests\n\n- Add control/service docs under `sdk/python/packages/flet/docs/<name>`.\n- Add all custom enums/types docs and update `sdk/python/packages/flet/mkdocs.yml` navigation.\n- Use markdown filenames without underscores (`codeeditor.md`, not `code_editor.md`).\n- Add examples under `sdk/python/examples` in the appropriate category for control vs service.\n- Add integration tests under `packages/flet/integration_tests` in the appropriate category for control vs service.\n- Ensure generated screenshots are suitable for docs usage when visual examples are added.\n\n## Upgrade and Compatibility Guardrails\n\n- Add at least one test that catches upstream behavioral changes likely to break wrapper mapping.\n- Avoid exposing experimental upstream APIs unless explicitly requested.\n- Keep wrapper surface narrow enough to maintain backwards compatibility across upstream updates.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Run relevant Python and integration tests for touched areas.\n- Verify Python import paths, client runtime registration, and docs navigation.\n- Verify dependency resolution and lockfile updates are intentional.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:05:48.131Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cross-Platform Agents needing to build real-time web, mobile, and desktop apps in Python using Flet and external Flutter packages.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Python 构建实时 Web、移动和桌面应用的跨平台代理，使用 Flet 和外部 Flutter 包。","ja":"Python を使用して Flet と外部の Flutter パッケージでリアルタイムの Web、モバイル、デスクトップ アプリを構築する必要があるクロスプラットフォーム エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python을 사용하여 Flet과 외부 Flutter 패키지를 사용하여 실시간 웹, 모바일, 데스크톱 앱을 구축해야 하는 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que necesitan crear aplicaciones web, móviles y de escritorio en tiempo real en Python utilizando Flet y paquetes Flutter externos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de plateforme croisée ayant besoin de créer des applications web, mobiles et de bureau en temps réel en Python en utilisant Flet et des packages Flutter externes.","de":"Perfekt für Cross-Platform-Agents, die Echtzeit-Web-, Mobile- und Desktop-Anwendungen in Python mit Flet und externen Flutter-Paketen erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Cross-Platform que precisam criar aplicativos web, móveis e de desktop em tempo real em Python usando Flet e pacotes externos Flutter.","ru":"Идеально для кроссплатформенных агентов, которым необходимо создавать веб-, мобильные и настольные приложения в режиме реального времени на Python с использованием Flet и внешних пакетов Flutter.","ar":"مثالي لعميل cruz-المنصة التي تحتاج إلى بناء تطبيقات الويب والجوال وال سطح المكتب في الوقت الحقيقي باستخدام بايثون مع Flet و الحزم الخارجية Flutter."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create custom Flet extensions around external Flutter packages, exposing APIs with properties, methods, events, and types/enums, while ensuring compatibility and license checks through the third-party dependency gate with pub.dev package validation and null-safety confirmation.","zh":"赋予代理创建自定义 Flet 扩展的能力，使用外部 Flutter 包，暴露具有属性、方法、事件和类型/枚举的 API，同时通过第三方依赖门户进行兼容性和许可检查，使用 pub.dev 包验证和空安全确认。","ja":"エージェントが外部の Flutter パッケージを使用してカスタム Flet 拡張を作成し、プロパティ、メソッド、イベント、タイプ/列挙型を備えた API を公開することを可能にし、pub.dev パッケージの検証と null 安全性の確認を使用したサードパーティの依存関係ゲートを介した互換性とライセンスのチェックを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 외부 Flutter 패키지를 사용하여 사용자 지정 Flet 확장을 만들 수 있도록 하여 속성, 메서드, 이벤트 및 유형/열거형을 가진 API를 노출하고 pub.dev 패키지 유효성 검사 및 null 안전 확인을 사용하여 3차_party 종속성 게이트를 통해 호환성 및 라이선스 확인을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear extensiones personalizadas de Flet alrededor de paquetes Flutter externos, exponiendo API con propiedades, métodos, eventos y tipos/enums, mientras se garantiza la compatibilidad y las comprobaciones de licencia a través de la puerta de dependencia de terceros con validación de paquetes pub.dev y confirmación de seguridad nula.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des extensions Flet personnalisées autour de packages Flutter externes, en exposant des API avec des propriétés, des méthodes, des événements et des types/énumérations, tout en garantissant la compatibilité et les vérifications de licence via la passerelle de dépendance tierce avec validation de packages pub.dev et confirmation de sécurité nulle.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, benutzerdefinierte Flet-Erweiterungen um externe Flutter-Pakete herum zu erstellen, indem APIs mit Eigenschaften, Methoden, Ereignissen und Typen/Enum-Ausprägungen exponiert werden, während die Kompatibilität und Lizenzprüfungen durch das Gate der Drittanbieter-Abhängigkeit mit pub.dev-Paketvalidierung und Nullsicherheitsbestätigung sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem extensões Flet personalizadas em torno de pacotes externos Flutter, expondo APIs com propriedades, métodos, eventos e tipos/enuns, garantindo a compatibilidade e as verificações de licença por meio do gateway de dependência de terceiros com validação do pacote pub.dev e confirmação de segurança nula.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать пользовательские расширения Flet вокруг внешних пакетов Flutter,暴露я API с свойствами, методами, событиями и типами/перечислениями, обеспечивая совместимость и проверки лицензий через шлюз зависимостей третьих сторон с проверкой пакета pub.dev и подтверждением безопасности нулевого.","ar":"تمكين العميل من إنشاء امتدادات Flet مخصصة حول حزم Flutter الخارجية ، مع تعرض APIs مع الخصائص والأساليب والأحداث وأنواع /열举 ، مع ضمان التوافق والفحص الترخيص من خلال بوابة التبعية الثالثة مع التحقق من حزمة pub.dev وتأكيد السلامة من الصفر."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Flet extensions for existing Flutter packages","Building real-time web, mobile, and desktop apps in Python with custom extensions","Validating and confirming package health and license compatibility for Flet extensions"],"zh":["为现有的 Flutter 包实现 Flet 扩展","使用 Python 和自定义扩展构建实时 Web、移动和桌面应用","验证和确认 Flet 扩展的包健康和许可兼容性"],"ja":["既存の Flutter パッケージのための Flet 拡張の実装","Python とカスタム拡張機能を使用したリアルタイム Web、モバイル、デスクトップ アプリの構築","Flet 拡張機能のパッケージの正常性とライセンスの互換性の検証と確認"],"ko":["기존 Flutter 패키지에 대한 Flet 확장 구현","Python 및 사용자 지정 확장으로 실시간 웹, 모바일, 데스크톱 앱 구축","Flet 확장의 패키지 건강 및 라이선스 호환성의 유효성 검사 및 확인"],"es":["Implementar extensiones de Flet para paquetes Flutter existentes","Crear aplicaciones web, móviles y de escritorio en tiempo real en Python con extensiones personalizadas","Validar y confirmar la salud y la compatibilidad de licencia de los paquetes para extensiones de Flet"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des extensions Flet pour les packages Flutter existants","Créer des applications web, mobiles et de bureau en temps réel en Python avec des extensions personnalisées","Valider et confirmer la santé et la compatibilité de licence des packages pour les extensions Flet"],"de":["Implementierung von Flet-Erweiterungen für bestehende Flutter-Pakete","Erstellung von Echtzeit-Web-, Mobile- und Desktop-Anwendungen in Python mit benutzerdefinierten Erweiterungen","Validierung und Bestätigung der Paketgesundheit und Lizenzkompatibilität für Flet-Erweiterungen"],"pt":["Implementação de extensões Flet para pacotes Flutter existentes","Construção de aplicativos web, móveis e de desktop em tempo real em Python com extensões personalizadas","Validação e confirmação da saúde e compatibilidade de licença de pacotes para extensões Flet"],"ru":["Реализация расширений Flet для существующих пакетов Flutter","Создание веб-, мобильных и настольных приложений в режиме реального времени на Python с пользовательскими расширениями","Проверка и подтверждение здоровья и совместимости лицензий пакетов для расширений Flet"],"ar":["تنفيذ امتدادات Flet لحزم Flutter الموجودة","بناء تطبيقات الويب والجوال وال سطح المكتب في الوقت الحقيقي باستخدام بايثون مع امتدادات مخصصة","التحقق والتحقق من صحة ومتانة الترخيص لحزم امتدادات Flet"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing flet_* packages as implementation templates","Needs confirmation of package health, null-safety, and platform support","Limited to Python and Flet with external Flutter packages"],"zh":["需要现有的 flet_* 包作为实现模板","需要包健康、空安全性和平台支持的确认","仅限 Python 和 Flet，外部 Flutter 包"],"ja":["実装テンプレートとして既存の flet_* パッケージが必要","パッケージの正常性、null 安全性、およびプラットフォームのサポートの確認が必要","Python と Flet、外部の Flutter パッケージに限定される"],"ko":["구현 템플릿으로서 기존의 flet_* 패키지가 필요","패키지 건강, null 안전성 및 플랫폼 지원의 확인이 필요","Python 및 Flet, 외부 Flutter 패키지로 제한"],"es":["Requiere paquetes flet_* existentes como plantillas de implementación","Necesita confirmación de la salud del paquete, la seguridad nula y el soporte de plataforma","Limitado a Python y Flet con paquetes Flutter externos"],"fr":["Nécessite des packages flet_* existants comme modèles d''implémentation","A besoin d''une confirmation de la santé du package, de la sécurité nulle et du support de plateforme","Limité à Python et Flet avec des packages Flutter externes"],"de":["Benötigt vorhandene flet_*-Pakete als Implementierungsvorlagen","Benötigt Bestätigung der Paketgesundheit, der Nullsicherheit und der Plattformunterstützung","Begrenzt auf Python und Flet mit externen Flutter-Paketen"],"pt":["Exige pacotes flet_* existentes como modelos de implementação","Necessita de confirmação da saúde do pacote, segurança nula e suporte à plataforma","Limitado a Python e Flet com pacotes externos Flutter"],"ru":["Требует существующих пакетов flet_* в качестве шаблонов реализации","Требует подтверждения здоровья пакета, нулевой безопасности и поддержки платформы","Ограничен Python и Flet с внешними пакетами Flutter"],"ar":["يتطلب حزم flet_* الموجودة كأشكال تنفيذ","يحتاج إلى تأكيد صحة الحزمة وسلامة الصفر ودعم المنصة","محدود لبايثون و Flet مع الحزم الخارجية Flutter"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d8e77695ce90118a51c5be7399fb767a2b745842f1f665fa10426c74fbf54622","qualityScore":41}');
