,"fr":"Chitti MCP est un outil d''IA pour enregistrer et auditer les décisions","de":"Chitti MCP ist ein KI-Tool, um Entscheidungen aufzuzeichnen und zu überprüfen","pt":"O que é Chitti-MCP? É uma habilidade que fornece ferramentas de MCP para registro e auditoria de decisões","ru":"Что такое Chitti-MCP? Это навык, который предоставляет инструменты MCP для записи и аудита решений ИИ Агентов","ar":"ما هو Chitti-MCP؟ هو مهارة توفر أدوات MCP لتسجيل و التدقيق في القرارات للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Starts the MCP server using the `scripts/start_server.sh` command","Supports one-shot tool calls via `scripts/mcp_call.sh` with JSON payloads","Provides `chitti.decide` tool for recording decisions with `action`, `amount`, and `reason` parameters","Offers `chitti.recall` tool for querying decision history with filter support","Utilizes shell scripts for easy server management and tool invocation"],"zh":["MCP 服务器支持","快速开始脚本","决策记录工具","决策回忆工具","CLI 命令支持"],"ja":["MCP サーバー対応","クイックスタートスクリプト","決裁記録ツール","決裁再生ツール","CLI コマンド対応"],"ko":["MCP 서버 지원","빠른 시작 스크립트","결정 기록 도구","결정 회수 도구","CLI 명령어 지원"],"es":["Uso de scripts como start_server.sh y mcp_call.sh","Herramienta chitti.decide para grabar decisiones","Herramienta chitti.recall para consultar historial","Filtros como ''action'' y ''reason'' para la herramienta chitti.recall","Compatibilidad con comandos CLI"],"fr":["Utilisation de scripts tels que start_server.sh et mcp_call.sh","Outil chitti.decide pour enregistrer les décisions","Outil chitti.recall pour consulter l''historique","Filtres tels que ''action'' et ''reason'' pour l''outil chitti.recall","Compatibilité avec les commandes CLI"],"de":["Verwendung von Skripten wie start_server.sh und mcp_call.sh","Werkzeug chitti.decide, um Entscheidungen aufzuzeichnen","Werkzeug chitti.recall, um den Verlauf abzufragen","Filter wie ''action'' und ''reason'' für das Werkzeug chitti.recall","Kompatibilität mit CLI-Befehlen"],"pt":["Ferramenta chitti.decide para registrar decisões","Ferramenta chitti.recall para consultar histórico de decisões","Suporte a comandos CLI para execução de ferramentas","Suporte a scripts para automação de tarefas","Ferramentas de MCP para auditoria e registro de decisões"],"ru":["Инструмент chitti.decide для записи решений ИИ Агентов","Инструмент chitti.recall для запроса истории решений","Поддержка команд CLI для выполнения инструментов","Поддержка скриптов для автоматизации задач","Инструменты MCP для аудита и записи решений ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["أداة chitti.decide لتسجيل القرارات للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أداة chitti.recall لاستدعاء تاريخ القرارات","دعم أوامر CLI لتشغيل الأدوات","دعم السكريبتات للتحكم في المهام","أدوات MCP للتدقيق و التسجيل في القرارات للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use chitti-mcp","chitti-mcp setup guide","chitti-mcp decision management","chitti-mcp vs other AI agent skills","installing chitti-mcp","chitti-mcp tutorial for developers"],"zh":["Chitti MCP Skill","AI 工具","决策记录","MCP 服务器","CLI 命令","快速开始","开发者指南"],"ja":["Chitti MCP スキル","AI エージェント","決裁記録","MCP サーバー","CLI コマンド","クイックスタート","開発者ガイド"],"ko":["Chitti MCP 스킬","AI 도구","결정 기록","MCP 서버","CLI 명령어","빠른 시작","개발자 가이드"],"es":["Chitti MCP","Agentes de IA","Herramientas de IA","Grabación de decisiones","Auditoría de decisiones","Uso de scripts en IA","CLI para IA","Integración de IA con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Chitti MCP","Outils d''IA","Agents d''IA","Enregistrement de décisions","Audit de décisions","Utilisation de scripts dans l''IA","CLI pour l''IA","Intégration de l''IA avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Chitti MCP","KI-Tools","KI-Agenten","Aufzeichnung von Entscheidungen","Überprüfung von Entscheidungen","Verwendung von Skripten in der KI","CLI für KI","Integration von KI mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Chitti-MCP","Ferramentas de MCP","Registro de decisões","Auditoria de decisões","CLI","Scripts","Desenvolvimento de habilidades","IA","Agentes de IA"],"ru":["Chitti-MCP","Инструменты MCP","Запись решений","Аудит решений","CLI","Скрипты","Разработка навыков","ИИ","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Chitti-MCP","أدوات MCP","تسجيل القرارات","التدقيق في القرارات","CLI","السكريبتات","تطوير المهارات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"rahulmanuwas","repo":"chitti","repoPath":"rahulmanuwas/chitti","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.394Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"chitti-mcp","description":"Use this skill when you need to start or call Chittis MCP server (chitti.decide/recall/policy/audit) from Codex, keeping tool details out of context until invoked.","bodyPreview":"# Chitti MCP Skill\n\nUse this when you need to record, recall, or audit decisions via Chitti''s MCP tools.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Start the MCP server:\n  - `scripts/start_server.sh`\n- Call a tool in one shot (starts server, calls tool, exits):\n  - `scripts/mcp_call.sh chitti.decide ''{\"action\":\"pay\",\"amount\":5,\"currency\":\"USDC\",\"reason\":\"example\"}''`\n\n## When to use which tool\n\n- `chitti.decide`: record a decision (requires `action`, `amount`, `reason`).\n- `chitti.recall`: query history (filters like `a","body":"# Chitti MCP Skill\n\nUse this when you need to record, recall, or audit decisions via Chitti''s MCP tools.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Start the MCP server:\n  - `scripts/start_server.sh`\n- Call a tool in one shot (starts server, calls tool, exits):\n  - `scripts/mcp_call.sh chitti.decide ''{\"action\":\"pay\",\"amount\":5,\"currency\":\"USDC\",\"reason\":\"example\"}''`\n\n## When to use which tool\n\n- `chitti.decide`: record a decision (requires `action`, `amount`, `reason`).\n- `chitti.recall`: query history (filters like `action`, `to`, `outcome`, `query`, `limit`).\n- `chitti.policy.*`: manage/evaluate rules.\n- `chitti.audit`: fetch decision by id.\n\n## Notes\n\n- This skill wraps the existing MCP server; do not remove MCP if you need ChatGPT connectors or other MCP clients.\n- If a tool call fails, retry with valid JSON arguments and required fields.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:16.983Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Decision Management Agents requiring advanced tracking and auditing capabilities via Chitti''s MCP tools.","zh":"适用于需要高级跟踪和审计能力的决策管理代理，通过 Chitti''s MCP 工具实现。","ja":"Chitti''s MCP ツールを使用した高度な追跡および監査機能を必要とする決定管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Chitti''s MCP 도구를 사용하여 고급 추적 및 감사를 위한 의사 결정 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Decisiones que requieren capacidades de seguimiento y auditoría avanzadas a través de las herramientas MCP de Chitti.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de décision nécessitant des fonctionnalités de suivi et d''audit avancées via les outils MCP de Chitti.","de":"Ideal für Entscheidungsmanagement-Agenten, die erweiterte Nachverfolgungs- und Überwachungsfunktionen über Chittis MCP-Tools benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Decisões que exigem capacidades avançadas de rastreamento e auditoria via ferramentas MCP do Chitti.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления решениями, требующих расширенных возможностей отслеживания и аудита через инструменты MCP Chitti.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء إدارة القرار الذين يتطلبون متقدمة تتبع وقدرات التدقيق عبر أدوات MCP Chitti."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to record, recall, and audit decisions using Chitti''s MCP tools, supporting JSON-based data exchange and providing functionalities like decision tracking and history querying through tools like chitti.decide and chitti.recall.","zh":"赋予代理记录、回忆和审计决策的能力，使用 Chitti''s MCP 工具，支持 JSON 基础的数据交换，并提供诸如决策跟踪和历史查询等功能，通过工具如 chitti.decide 和 chitti.recall。","ja":"Chitti''s MCP ツールを使用して、JSON ベースのデータ交換をサポートし、chitti.decide および chitti.recall などのツールを使用して決定の追跡や履歴の照会などの機能を提供することで、エージェントが決定を記録、呼び出し、監査できるようにします。","ko":"Chitti''s MCP 도구를 사용하여 JSON 기반 데이터 교환을 지원하고 chitti.decide 및 chitti.recall과 같은 도구를 사용하여 결정 추적 및 기록 조회와 같은 기능을 제공함으로써 에이전트가 결정 기록, 회상 및 감사를 할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a grabar, recordar y auditar decisiones utilizando las herramientas MCP de Chitti, que admiten el intercambio de datos basado en JSON y proporcionan funcionalidades como el seguimiento de decisiones y la consulta de historial a través de herramientas como chitti.decide y chitti.recall.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enregistrer, de rappeler et d''auditer les décisions en utilisant les outils MCP de Chitti, qui prennent en charge l''échange de données basé sur JSON et fournissent des fonctionnalités comme le suivi des décisions et l''interrogation de l''historique via des outils comme chitti.decide et chitti.recall.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Entscheidungen mithilfe der MCP-Tools von Chitti aufzuzeichnen, abzurufen und zu überprüfen, wobei der Datenaustausch auf JSON basiert und Funktionen wie Entscheidungsverfolgung und Historienabfrage über Tools wie chitti.decide und chitti.recall bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a registrar, lembrar e auditar decisões usando as ferramentas MCP do Chitti, com suporte a troca de dados baseada em JSON e fornecendo funcionalidades como rastreamento de decisões e consulta de histórico por meio de ferramentas como chitti.decide e chitti.recall.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью записывать, воспоминать и аудировать решения с помощью инструментов MCP Chitti, поддерживая обмен данными на основе JSON и предоставляя функциональность, такую как отслеживание решений и запрос истории с помощью инструментов, таких как chitti.decide и chitti.recall.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تسجيل و استدعاء و تدقيق القرارات باستخدام أدوات MCP Chitti ، مع دعم交換 البيانات المعتمدة على JSON و توفير الوظائف مثل تتبع القرار و استعلام التاريخ من خلال أدوات مثل chitti.decide و chitti.recall."},"useCases":{"en":["Recording financial decisions with chitti.decide","Querying decision history with chitti.recall","Auditing actions through MCP server logs"],"zh":["使用 chitti.decide 记录财务决策","使用 chitti.recall 查询决策历史","通过 MCP 服务器日志审计操作"],"ja":["chitti.decide を使用して財務上の決定を記録する","chitti.recall を使用して決定履歴を照会する","MCP サーバーのログを使用して操作を監査する"],"ko":["chitti.decide를 사용하여 재무 결정 기록","chitti.recall을 사용하여 결정 기록 조회","MCP 서버 로그를 통해 작업 감사"],"es":["Grabación de decisiones financieras con chitti.decide","Consulta del historial de decisiones con chitti.recall","Auditoría de acciones a través de los registros del servidor MCP"],"fr":["Enregistrement de décisions financières avec chitti.decide","Interrogation de l''historique des décisions avec chitti.recall","Audit des actions via les journaux du serveur MCP"],"de":["Aufzeichnung von Finanzentscheidungen mit chitti.decide","Abfrage der Entscheidungshistorie mit chitti.recall","Überprüfung von Aktionen über die Server-Logs des MCP"],"pt":["Gravação de decisões financeiras com chitti.decide","Consulta de histórico de decisões com chitti.recall","Auditoria de ações por meio de logs do servidor MCP"],"ru":["Запись финансовых решений с помощью chitti.decide","Запрос истории решений с помощью chitti.recall","Аудит действий через журналы сервера MCP"],"ar":["تسجيل القرارات المالية مع chitti.decide","استعلام تاريخ القرار مع chitti.recall","تدقيق الإجراءات من خلال سجلات خادم MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP server setup and startup via scripts/start_server.sh","Dependent on Chitti''s MCP tools and their compatibility"],"zh":["需要通过 scripts/start_server.sh 设置和启动 MCP 服务器","依赖于 Chitti''s MCP 工具及其兼容性"],"ja":["scripts/start_server.sh を使用して MCP サーバーを設定および起動する必要がある","Chitti''s MCP ツール及其の互換性に依存する"],"ko":["scripts/start_server.sh를 사용하여 MCP 서버 설정 및 시작이 필요함","Chitti''s MCP 도구 및 해당 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración y arranque del servidor MCP a través de scripts/start_server.sh","Depende de las herramientas MCP de Chitti y su compatibilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration et le démarrage du serveur MCP via scripts/start_server.sh","Dépend des outils MCP de Chitti et de leur compatibilité"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung und den Start des MCP-Servers über scripts/start_server.sh","Hängt von den MCP-Tools von Chitti und ihrer Kompatibilität ab"],"pt":["Exige configuração e inicialização do servidor MCP via scripts/start_server.sh","Dependente das ferramentas MCP do Chitti e sua compatibilidade"],"ru":["Требует настройки и запуска сервера MCP через scripts/start_server.sh","Зависит от инструментов MCP Chitti и их совместимости"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتشغيل خادم MCP من خلال scripts/start_server.sh","يعتمد على أدوات MCP Chitti ومتطلباتها"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"03d039d92fe305a2a27ccf8a111f002e93c76f9ff2df119455bed53e02bbb7d7","qualityScore":41}');
