INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('bardway/mingriAgency/mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance', 'mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance', 'bardway', 'mingriAgency', 'community', 'mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance bardway mingriAgency community mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance ensures consistency across data source files, TypeScript definitions, and loader hooks, benefiting developers working with CoC7 knowledgebase entries. CoC7 知识库维护 AIエージェント 负责保持数据一致性和优化性能 CoC7 ナレッジベース メンテナンス AIエージェント はデータの一貫性を維持し、パフォーマンスを最適化する CoC7 知识库 유지보수 AI 에이전트는 데이터 일관성을 유지하고 성능을 최적화합니다 mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance mantiene la base de conocimientos CoC7 consistente a través de archivos JSON, definiciones de TypeScript y hooks de cargador. mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance maintient la base de connaissances CoC7 cohérente à travers des fichiers JSON, des définitions TypeScript et des hooks de chargement. mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance hält die CoC7-Knowledgebase konsistent über JSON-Dateien, TypeScript-Definitionen und Lader-Hooks. Uma skill de IA Agent para desenvolvimento que gerencia a consistência da base de conhecimento do CoC7 entre arquivos de dados JSON, definições TypeScript, hooks de carregamento React e estratégias de caching. Essencial para normalização de dados e performance. ИИ Агент для разработки, обеспечивающий согласованность базы знаний CoC7 между JSON файлами, TypeScript определениями, React hooks и стратегиями кэширования. Ключевой инструмент для нормализации данных и производительности. أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للتطوير تدير اتساق قاعدة معرفة CoC7 بين ملفات JSON وتعريفات TypeScript وخطافات React واستراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت. ضرورية لتطبيع البيانات والأداء. how to use mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance setup guide CoC7 knowledgebase maintenance JSON data consistency TypeScript definition management loader hook optimization mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance alternative mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance vs other maintenance tools mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance install CoC7 知识库维护 AIエージェント 数据一致性 性能优化 TypeScript loader hooks 缓存策略 路径不变量 Maintains consistency across `data/*.json` source files and TypeScript definitions (`src/types/...`) Ensures data load performance and caching behavior optimization Supports normalization and deduplication of knowledgebase data Updates auxiliary equipment datasets, including weapons, armor, and vehicles Utilizes loader hooks, such as `useCoc7Data`, for efficient data loading mingri-coc7-knowledgebase-maintenance is a skill that maintains consistency across CoC7 knowledgebase data, including JSON files, TypeScript definitions, and caching strategies.');
