"Prise en charge de la version Express d''Astro Bookings"],"de":["Erstellung detaillierter Implementierungspläne","Berücksichtigung der Architektur und des Designs von Astro Bookings","Kompatibilität mit der FunktionsSpezifikation von Astro Bookings","Integration mit dem Architektur-Design-Dokument","Erstellung effektiver Implementierungspläne","Unterstützung für die Express-Version von Astro Bookings"],"pt":["Geração de plano de implementação detalhado","Consideração de requisitos de especificação","Análise de restrições de arquitetura e design","Integração com o arquivo de especificação","Compatibilidade com o documento de design arquitetônico"],"ru":["Генерация подробного плана реализации","Учет требований спецификации","Анализ ограничений архитектуры и дизайна","Интеграция со спецификационным файлом","Совместимость с архитектурным документом дизайна"],"ar":["توليد خطة تنفيذ مفصلة","الاعتبار المتقدم لمتطلبات المواصفات","تحليل قيود التصميم المعماري","التكامل مع ملف المواصفات","التوافق مع وثيقة التصميم المعماري"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use planning-specs","planning-specs implementation guide","planning-specs vs other AI agent skills","planning-specs setup for Astro Bookings","what is planning-specs","planning-specs alternative for Express version"],"zh":["planning-specs","AI エージェント","Astro Bookings","实现计划","Specification 文件","Architectural Design Document","设计约束","架构"],"ja":["planning-specs","AI エージェント","Astro Bookings","実装計画","Specification ファイル","Architectural Design Document","設計制約","アーキテクチャ"],"ko":["planning-specs","AI 에이전트","Astro Bookings","구현 계획","Specification 파일","Architectural Design Document","디자인 제약","아키텍처"],"es":["planning-specs","Astro Bookings","herramientas de AI","planes de implementación","arquitectura de software","diseño de software","especificación de características","documento de diseño arquitectónico","versión Express"],"fr":["planning-specs","Astro Bookings","outils d''IA","plans de mise en œuvre","architecture logicielle","conception logicielle","spécification des fonctionnalités","document de conception architecturale","version Express"],"de":["planning-specs","Astro Bookings","AI-Tools","Implementierungspläne","Software-Architektur","Software-Design","FunktionsSpezifikation","Architektur-Design-Dokument","Express-Version"],"pt":["planejamento de especificações","astro bookings","guia de implementação","especificações técnicas","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de ai","agentes de ai","planejamento de projetos","gestão de projetos"],"ru":["планирование спецификаций","astro bookings","руководство по реализации","технические спецификации","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты ИИ","ИИ агенты","планирование проектов","управление проектами"],"ar":["تخطيط المواصفات","استخدامات astro bookings","دليل التنفيذ","المواصفات الفنية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تخطيط المشاريع","إدارة المشاريع"]}},"owner":"AlbertoBasalo","repo":"astro-bookings-express","repoPath":"AlbertoBasalo/astro-bookings-express","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"planning-specs","description":"Creates a detailed implementation plan for a given feature specification. To be used for planning the implementation of feature specifications.","bodyPreview":"# Generate Plan Skill\n\nWrite a detailed implementation plan for a given feature specification.\n\nThe plan will be a set of ordered steps, each with specific tasks to complete.\n\n## Context\n\n- [The Specification file](.agents/specs/?short-name.spec.md)\n- [Architectural Design Document](.agents/ADD.md)\n\n## Steps to follow:\n\n### Step 1: Think about the overall implementation.\n - [ ] Understand the specification requirements.\n - [ ] Consider the architecture and design constraints from the ADD.\n - [ ]","body":"# Generate Plan Skill\n\nWrite a detailed implementation plan for a given feature specification.\n\nThe plan will be a set of ordered steps, each with specific tasks to complete.\n\n## Context\n\n- [The Specification file](.agents/specs/?short-name.spec.md)\n- [Architectural Design Document](.agents/ADD.md)\n\n## Steps to follow:\n\n### Step 1: Think about the overall implementation.\n - [ ] Understand the specification requirements.\n - [ ] Consider the architecture and design constraints from the ADD.\n - [ ] Choose the simplest viable approach to implement the spec.\n### Step 2: Decompose the implementation in steps.\n - [ ] Break down the implementation into 3 to 9 steps \n - [ ] Ensure each step is an ordered logical unit of work.\n### Step 3: Define tasks for each step.\n - [ ] For each step, list specific tasks (<= 5) needed to complete it.\n - [ ] Ensure tasks are clear and actionable.\n### Step 4: Write the implementation plan.\n - [ ] Follow the format in the [Implementation Plan template](./PLAN.md).\n - [ ] Write the plan to a markdown file at `.agents/tasks/short-name.plan.md`.\n### Step 5: Review and finalize the plan.\n - [ ] Ensure the plan is comprehensive and feasible.\n - [ ] Mark the specification status as \"Planned\" at the top of the spec file.\n\n## Output Checklist\n\n- [ ] A detailed implementation plan at `.agents/tasks/short-name.plan.md`.\n- [ ] The specification status updated to \"Planned\" in the spec file."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:16.995Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Workflow Agents requiring structured implementation planning from feature specifications.","zh":"非常适合需要根据功能规范进行结构化实施规划的开发工作流程代理。","ja":"機能仕様から構造化された実装計画を必要とする開発ワークフローエージェントに理想的です。","ko":"기능 사양에서 구조화된 구현 계획이 필요한 개발 워크플로우 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de flujo de trabajo de desarrollo que requieren una planificación de implementación estructurada a partir de especificaciones de características.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de flux de travail de développement nécessitant une planification d''implémentation structurée à partir de spécifications de fonctionnalités.","de":"Ideal für Development Workflow Agents, die eine strukturierte Implementierungsplanung auf der Grundlage von Featurespezifikationen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho de Desenvolvimento que requerem planejamento de implementação estruturada a partir de especificações de recursos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Рабочего Процесса Разработки, требующих структурированного планирования реализации на основе спецификаций функций.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء سير عمل التطوير الذين يتطلبون تخطيط تنفيذ منظم من مواصفات الميزات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Generates detailed, ordered implementation plans by analyzing feature specifications against architectural design constraints. Enforces systematic task decomposition with specific completion criteria for Astro Bookings development.","zh":"通过分析功能规范与架构设计约束，生成详细、有序的实施计划。为Astro Bookings开发强制执行系统化的任务分解，并设定具体的完成标准。","ja":"機能仕様をアーキテクチャ設計上の制約と照合して分析することで、詳細かつ順序立てられた実装計画を生成します。Astro Bookings開発のために、特定の完了基準を持つ体系的なタスク分解を強制します。","ko":"아키텍처 설계 제약 조건에 대해 기능 사양을 분석하여 상세하고 순서화된 구현 계획을 생성합니다. Astro Bookings 개발을 위해 구체적인 완료 기준을 가진 체계적인 작업 분해를 시행합니다.","es":"Genera planes de implementación detallados y ordenados mediante el análisis de especificaciones de características frente a restricciones de diseño arquitectónico. Impone una descomposición sistemática de tareas con criterios de finalización específicos para el desarrollo de Astro Bookings.","fr":"Génère des plans d''implémentation détaillés et ordonnés en analysant les spécifications de fonctionnalités par rapport aux contraintes de conception architecturale. Applique une décomposition systématique des tâches avec des critères d''achèvement spécifiques pour le développement d''Astro Bookings.","de":"Erstellt detaillierte, geordnete Implementierungspläne durch die Analyse von Featurespezifikationen im Hinblick auf Architektur-Design-Einschränkungen. Erzwingt eine systematische Aufgabenzerlegung mit spezifischen Abschlusskriterien für die Astro Bookings-Entwicklung.","pt":"Gera planos de implementação detalhados e ordenados analisando especificações de recursos em relação às restrições de design arquitetônico. Impõe uma decomposição sistemática de tarefas com critérios específicos de conclusão para o desenvolvimento do Astro Bookings.","ru":"Генерирует детальные, упорядоченные планы реализации путем анализа спецификаций функций в соответствии с ограничениями архитектурного проектирования. Обеспечивает систематическую декомпозицию задач с конкретными критериями завершения для разработки Astro Bookings.","ar":"يولد خطط تنفيذ مفصلة ومرتبة من خلال تحليل مواصفات الميزات مقابل قيود التصميم المعماري. يفرض تحليلًا منهجيًا للمهام مع معايير إنجاز محددة لتطوير Astro Bookings."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating feature specs into actionable development tasks","Ensuring architectural compliance during implementation planning","Creating milestone-driven project timelines","Decomposing complex features into atomic development units"],"zh":["将功能规格转化为可操作的开发任务","在实施规划期间确保架构合规性","创建里程碑驱动的项目时间表","将复杂功能分解为原子开发单元"],"ja":["機能仕様を実行可能な開発タスクに変換","実装計画中のアーキテクチャ準拠の確保","マイルストーン駆動型のプロジェクトタイムラインの作成","複雑な機能を原子開発単位に分解"],"ko":["기능 사양을 실행 가능한 개발 작업으로 변환","구현 계획 중 아키텍처 준수 보장","마일스톤 기반 프로젝트 타임라인 생성","복잡한 기능을 원자 개발 단위로 분해"],"es":["Traducir especificaciones de características en tareas de desarrollo accionables","Garantizar el cumplimiento arquitectónico durante la planificación de la implementación","Crear cronogramas de proyectos basados en hitos","Descomponer características complejas en unidades de desarrollo atómicas"],"fr":["Traduire les spécifications de fonctionnalités en tâches de développement actionnables","Garantir la conformité architecturale pendant la planification de l''implémentation","Créer des calendriers de projet pilotés par des jalons","Décomposer des fonctionnalités complexes en unités de développement atomiques"],"de":["Übersetzen von Featurespezifikationen in umsetzbare Development Tasks","Sicherstellung der Architekturkonformität während der Implementierungsplanung","Erstellung von meilensteinorientierten Projektzeitplänen","Zerlegung komplexer Features in atomare Development Units"],"pt":["Traduzir especificações de recursos em tarefas de desenvolvimento acionáveis","Garantir conformidade arquitetônica durante o planejamento de implementação","Criar cronogramas de projetos orientados por marcos","Decompor recursos complexos em unidades de desenvolvimento atômicas"],"ru":["Преобразование спецификаций функций в выполняемые задачи разработки","Обеспечение соответствия архитектуре во время планирования реализации","Создание вех-ориентированных графиков проекта","Разложение сложных функций на атомарные единицы разработки"],"ar":["ترجمة مواصفات الميزات إلى مهام تطوير قابلة للتنفيذ","ضمان الامتثال المعماري أثناء تخطيط التنفيذ","إنشاء جداول زمنية للمشاريع تعتمد على المعالم","تحليل الميزات المعقدة إلى وحدات تطوير ذرية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to specification files (.agents/specs/)","Dependent on Architectural Design Document availability","Astro Bookings context-specific implementation"],"zh":["需要访问规范文件 (.agents/specs/)","依赖于架构设计文档的可用性","特定于Astro Bookings上下文的实现"],"ja":["仕様ファイル (.agents/specs/) へのアクセスが必要","アーキテクチャ設計文書の可用性に依存","Astro Bookingsコンテキスト固有の実装"],"ko":["사양 파일(.agents/specs/)에 대한 액세스 필요","아키텍처 설계 문서 가용성에 의존","Astro Bookings 컨텍스트별 구현"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de especificación (.agents/specs/)","Depende de la disponibilidad del Documento de Diseño Arquitectónico","Implementación específica del contexto de Astro Bookings"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de spécification (.agents/specs/)","Dépend de la disponibilité du Document de Conception Architecturale","Implémentation spécifique au contexte d''Astro Bookings"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Spezifikationsdateien (.agents/specs/)","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit des Architectural Design Documents","Astro Bookings kontextspezifische Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de especificação (.agents/specs/)","Dependente da disponibilidade do Documento de Design Arquitetônico","Implementação específica do contexto do Astro Bookings"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам спецификаций (.agents/specs/)","Зависит от доступности Документа Архитектурного Проектирования","Реализация, специфичная для контекста Astro Bookings"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات المواصفات (.agents/specs/)","يعتمد على توفر وثيقة التصميم المعماري","تنفيذ خاص بسياق Astro Bookings"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f5a079d705f2751bd45b12d52593cedd8833a82ad000861afbcc84348871ab89","qualityScore":41}');
