":"NestJS 异常创建是指创建标准化的异常处理机制，用于处理应用程序中的错误和异常","ja":"NestJS 例外作成とは、標準化された例外処理メカニズムを作成することであり、应用程序の中でのエラーと例外を処理するために使用されます","ko":"NestJS 예외 생성은 표준화된 예외 처리 메커니즘을 생성하는 것을 의미하며, 애플리케이션의 오류와 예외를 처리하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Una excepción NestJS personalizada es una clase que sigue patrones de proyecto y utiliza BaseExceptionDto y ExceptionTypeEnum para manejar errores de manera estandarizada","fr":"Une exception NestJS personnalisée est une classe qui suit les modèles de projet et utilise BaseExceptionDto et ExceptionTypeEnum pour gérer les erreurs de manière standardisée","de":"Eine benutzerdefinierte NestJS-Ausnahme ist eine Klasse, die Projektmustern folgt und BaseExceptionDto und ExceptionTypeEnum verwendet, um Fehler standardisiert zu verarbeiten","pt":"O Create NestJS Exception é um modelo de projeto para criar exceções padrão em NestJS.","ru":"Create NestJS Exception - это шаблон проекта для создания стандартизированных исключений в NestJS.","ar":"إنشاء استثناءات NestJS هو قالب مشروع لإنشاء استثناءات معيارية في NestJS."},"features":{"en":["Creates exceptions following the {Concept}{Action}Exception naming convention","Utilizes BaseExceptionDto for standardized exception handling","Allows selection from available ExceptionTypeEnum types","Supports addition of Swagger documentation for exceptions","Enables reuse of core exceptions like NotFoundException and CustomBadRequestException","Determines exception location, whether feature-specific or core/reusable"],"zh":["核心异常复用","特性特定或核心异常创建","遵循 {Concept}{Action}Exception 命名约定","使用 BaseExceptionDto","选择 ExceptionTypeEnum","添加 Swagger 文档"],"ja":["コア例外の再利用","特性特定またはコア例外の作成"," {Concept}{Action}Exception 命名規約の遵守","BaseExceptionDto の使用","ExceptionTypeEnum の選択","Swagger ドキュメントの追加"],"ko":["코어 예외 재사용","특성 특정 또는 코어 예외 생성"," {Concept}{Action}Exception 명명 규칙을 따름","BaseExceptionDto 사용","ExceptionTypeEnum 선택","Swagger 문서 추가"],"es":["Uso de BaseExceptionDto para estandarizar excepciones","Selección de ExceptionTypeEnum para categorizar errores","Creación de excepciones personalizadas siguiendo patrones de proyecto","Incorporación de documentación de Swagger para excepciones","Reutilización de excepciones core como NotFoundException y CustomBadRequestException"],"fr":["Utilisation de BaseExceptionDto pour standardiser les exceptions","Sélection de ExceptionTypeEnum pour catégoriser les erreurs","Création d''exceptions personnalisées en suivant les modèles de projet","Intégration de la documentation Swagger pour les exceptions","Réutilisation d''exceptions core comme NotFoundException et CustomBadRequestException"],"de":["Verwendung von BaseExceptionDto zur Standardisierung von Ausnahmen","Auswahl von ExceptionTypeEnum zur Kategorisierung von Fehlern","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Ausnahmen unter Verwendung von Projektmustern","Integration der Swagger-Dokumentation für Ausnahmen","Wiederverwendung von Core-Ausnahmen wie NotFoundException und CustomBadRequestException"],"pt":["Crie exceções padrão seguindo os padrões do projeto","Reutilize exceções core como NotFoundException e CustomBadRequestException","Defina a localização da exceção como feature-specific ou core/reusable","Siga a convenção de nomenclatura {Concept}{Action}Exception","Use BaseExceptionDto para todos os tipos de exceções","Escolha o tipo de exceção a partir do ExceptionTypeEnum"],"ru":["Создавайте стандартизированные исключения, следуя шаблонам проекта","Переиспользуйте核心 исключения, такие как NotFoundException и CustomBadRequestException для ИИ Агентов","Определите местоположение исключения как feature-specific или core/reusable","Следуйте соглашению об именовании {Concept}{Action}Exception","Используйте BaseExceptionDto для всех типов исключений","Выберите тип исключения из ExceptionTypeEnum"],"ar":["أنشئ استثناءات معيارية متبعة للأنماط المشروع","إعادة استخدام الاستثناءات الأساسية مثل NotFoundException و CustomBadRequestException لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحديد موقع الاستثناء كخاص بالملامح أو معاد توزيعه","اتبع اتفاقية التسمية {Concept}{Action}Exception","استخدم BaseExceptionDto لجميع أنواع الاستثناءات","اختر نوع الاستثناء من ExceptionTypeEnum"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use create-nestjs-exception","create-nestjs-exception setup guide","NestJS exception handling best practices","create-nestjs-exception vs custom exception handling","install create-nestjs-exception","what is create-nestjs-exception","create-nestjs-exception alternative","create-nestjs-exception tutorial","NestJS project starter template","standardized exception handling in NestJS"],"zh":["NestJS 异常创建","AIエージェント","标准化异常","异常处理","错误处理","NestJS 开发","后端开发","Node.js"],"ja":["NestJS 例外作成","AIエージェント","標準化された例外","例外処理","エラー処理","NestJS 開発","バックエンド開発","Node.js"],"ko":["NestJS 예외 생성","AI 도구","표준화된 예외","예외 처리","오류 처리","NestJS 개발","백엔드 개발","Node.js"],"es":["excepciones NestJS","creación de excepciones personalizadas","BaseExceptionDto","ExceptionTypeEnum","patrones de proyecto NestJS","errores personalizados en NestJS","documentación de Swagger para excepciones"],"fr":["exceptions NestJS","création d''exceptions personnalisées","BaseExceptionDto","ExceptionTypeEnum","modèles de projet NestJS","erreurs personnalisées dans NestJS","documentation Swagger pour les exceptions"],"de":["NestJS-Ausnahmen","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Ausnahmen","BaseExceptionDto","ExceptionTypeEnum","Projektmodelle für NestJS","benutzerdefinierte Fehler in NestJS","Swagger-Dokumentation für Ausnahmen"],"pt":["NestJS","exceções padrão","NotFoundException","CustomBadRequestException","BaseExceptionDto","ExceptionTypeEnum","criar exceções NestJS","guia de configuração NestJS","boas práticas NestJS"],"ru":["NestJS","стандартизированные исключения","NotFoundException","CustomBadRequestException","BaseExceptionDto","ExceptionTypeEnum","создание исключений NestJS","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов","лучшие практики NestJS"],"ar":["NestJS","استثناءات معيارية","NotFoundException","CustomBadRequestException","BaseExceptionDto","ExceptionTypeEnum","إنشاء استثناءات NestJS","دليل الإعداد لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أفضل الممارسات NestJS"]}},"owner":"sharifli4","repo":"nestjs-infra-template","repoPath":"sharifli4/nestjs-infra-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.498Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-nestjs-exception","description":"Create standardized exceptions following the templates exception system. Use when the user asks to create an exception, error class, or custom error handling, or mentions exception, error, throw, or HTTP status codes.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Create NestJS Exception\n\nCreate standardized exceptions following this project''s patterns.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen creating an exception:\n\n1. **Check if a core exception exists first** - Can you reuse `NotFoundException`, `CustomBadRequestException`?\n2. **Determine location** - Feature-specific or core/reusable?\n3. **Follow naming** - `{Concept}{Action}Exception`\n4. **Use BaseExceptionDto** - Required for all exceptions\n5. **Pick ExceptionTypeEnum** - From available types\n6. **Add Swagger docs**","body":"# Create NestJS Exception\n\nCreate standardized exceptions following this project''s patterns.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen creating an exception:\n\n1. **Check if a core exception exists first** - Can you reuse `NotFoundException`, `CustomBadRequestException`?\n2. **Determine location** - Feature-specific or core/reusable?\n3. **Follow naming** - `{Concept}{Action}Exception`\n4. **Use BaseExceptionDto** - Required for all exceptions\n5. **Pick ExceptionTypeEnum** - From available types\n6. **Add Swagger docs** - Document in controller\n\n## Exception Template\n\n```typescript\n// Location:\n// - Feature-specific: src/features/{feature}/exceptions/{exception-name}.exception.ts\n// - Reusable: src/core/exceptions/http/{exception-name}.exception.ts\n\nimport { HttpException, HttpStatus } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { ExceptionTypeEnum, BaseExceptionDto } from ''@/core/exceptions'';\n\n/**\n * Thrown when [describe specific condition]\n * \n * @example\n * throw new {ExceptionName}(identifier);\n */\nexport class {ExceptionName} extends HttpException {\n  constructor(identifier: string | number) {\n    const baseExceptionDto = BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException(\n      [identifier.toString()],\n      HttpStatus.{STATUS_CODE},\n      ExceptionTypeEnum.{TYPE},\n      ''{Detailed error message}'',\n    );\n    super(baseExceptionDto, HttpStatus.{STATUS_CODE});\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Available Exception Types\n\n```typescript\nExceptionTypeEnum.BAD_REQUEST           // Invalid request data\nExceptionTypeEnum.NOT_FOUND             // Resource not found\nExceptionTypeEnum.VALIDATION            // DTO validation failures\nExceptionTypeEnum.UNAUTHORIZED          // No authentication\nExceptionTypeEnum.FORBIDDEN             // Insufficient permissions\nExceptionTypeEnum.CONFLICT              // Resource conflict\nExceptionTypeEnum.UNIQUE_VIOLATION      // DB unique constraint\nExceptionTypeEnum.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY  // Cannot process valid request\nExceptionTypeEnum.INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR // Server-side errors\n```\n\n## Quick Patterns\n\n### Not Found\n```typescript\nexport class {Resource}NotFoundException extends HttpException {\n  constructor(id: string) {\n    const baseExceptionDto = BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException(\n      [id],\n      HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND,\n      ExceptionTypeEnum.NOT_FOUND,\n      `{Resource} with ID ${id} not found`,\n    );\n    super(baseExceptionDto, HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Validation with Multiple Fields\n```typescript\nexport class Invalid{Resource}DataException extends HttpException {\n  constructor(fields: string[], detail: string) {\n    const baseExceptionDto = BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException(\n      fields,\n      HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST,\n      ExceptionTypeEnum.VALIDATION,\n      detail,\n    );\n    super(baseExceptionDto, HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Business Logic\n```typescript\nexport class {BusinessRule}Exception extends HttpException {\n  constructor(detail: string) {\n    const baseExceptionDto = BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException(\n      [],\n      HttpStatus.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY,\n      ExceptionTypeEnum.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY,\n      detail,\n    );\n    super(baseExceptionDto, HttpStatus.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Reuse Core Exceptions\n\n**Always check first:** Can you use an existing core exception?\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  CustomBadRequestException,\n  NotFoundException,\n  UnauthorizedException,\n  ForbiddenException,\n  DatabaseOperationException,\n} from ''@/core/exceptions'';\n\n// Generic not found\nthrow new NotFoundException(''User'', userId);\n\n// Generic validation\nthrow new CustomBadRequestException(\n  [''email''],\n  ExceptionTypeEnum.VALIDATION,\n  ''Invalid email format''\n);\n```\n\n**Create custom exceptions only when:**\n- Core exceptions don''t cover the use case\n- You need feature-specific error details\n- You want better type safety\n\n## Swagger Documentation\n\nAlways document in controllers:\n\n```typescript\nimport { ApiCustomExceptionResponse } from ''@/core/exceptions'';\n\n@Post()\n@ApiCustomExceptionResponse(400, ''Invalid data'')\n@ApiCustomExceptionResponse(409, ''Resource conflict'')\nasync create(@Body() dto: CreateDto) {\n  // Implementation\n}\n```\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore creating an exception:\n\n- [ ] Checked if core exceptions can be reused\n- [ ] Determined location (feature-specific or core)\n- [ ] Name follows `{Concept}{Action}Exception` format\n- [ ] Extends `HttpException`\n- [ ] Uses `BaseExceptionDto.CreateBaseException()`\n- [ ] Includes proper `ExceptionTypeEnum`\n- [ ] Has JSDoc with description and example\n- [ ] Target array specifies relevant fields\n- [ ] Documented with `@ApiCustomExceptionResponse`\n\n## Rules\n\n❌ **NEVER** use raw NestJS exceptions:\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG\nthrow new BadRequestException(''Error'');\nthrow new NotFoundException(''Not found'');\n```\n\n✅ **ALWAYS** use BaseExceptionDto system:\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT\nthrow new NotFoundException(''User'', userId);\n// Or create custom\nthrow new UserNotFoundException(userId);\n```\n\n⚠️ **PREFER** core exceptions when possible - don''t create unnecessary custom exceptions.\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nSee `.cursor/rules/exceptions.mdc` for complete rules and patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:15.473Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for NestJS Development Agents needing standardized error handling implementation.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化错误处理实现的 NestJS 开发智能体。","ja":"標準化されたエラーハンドリング実装を必要とする NestJS 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 오류 처리 구현이 필요한 NestJS 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo de NestJS que necesitan implementar un manejo de errores estandarizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement NestJS ayant besoin d''une implémentation standardisée de la gestion d''erreurs.","de":"Perfekt für NestJS-Entwicklungs-Agents, die eine standardisierte Implementierung der Fehlerbehandlung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento NestJS que necessitam de uma implementação padronizada de tratamento de erros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки на NestJS, которым требуется стандартизированная реализация обработки ошибок.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير NestJS الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ معالجة أخطاء موحدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to generate standardized NestJS exceptions following project-specific patterns, ensuring consistent error handling with BaseExceptionDto integration, ExceptionTypeEnum selection, and automatic Swagger documentation generation.","zh":"使智能体能够遵循项目特定模式生成标准化的 NestJS 异常，通过集成 BaseExceptionDto、选择 ExceptionTypeEnum 以及自动生成 Swagger 文档，确保一致的错误处理。","ja":"BaseExceptionDto の統合、ExceptionTypeEnum の選択、Swagger ドキュメントの自動生成により、一貫したエラーハンドリングを確保し、プロジェクト固有のパターンに従った標準的な NestJS 例外をエージェントが生成できるようにします。","ko":"프로젝트별 패턴에 따라 표준화된 NestJS 예외를 생성하여 BaseExceptionDto 통합, ExceptionTypeEnum 선택 및 자동 Swagger 문서 생성을 통해 일관된 오류 처리를 보장하도록 에이전트를 활성화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar excepciones NestJS estandarizadas siguiendo patrones específicos del proyecto, garantizando un manejo de errores consistente con la integración de BaseExceptionDto, selección de ExceptionTypeEnum y generación automática de documentación Swagger.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des exceptions NestJS standardisées en suivant des modèles spécifiques au projet, assurant une gestion d''erreurs cohérente avec l''intégration de BaseExceptionDto, la sélection de ExceptionTypeEnum et la génération automatique de documentation Swagger.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, standardisierte NestJS-Exceptions gemäß projektspezifischer Muster zu generieren, wodurch eine konsistente Fehlerbehandlung mit BaseExceptionDto-Integration, ExceptionTypeEnum-Auswahl und automatischer Swagger-Dokumentationsgenerierung gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem exceções NestJS padronizadas seguindo padrões específicos do projeto, garantindo um tratamento de erros consistente com integração BaseExceptionDto, seleção ExceptionTypeEnum e geração automática de documentação Swagger.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать стандартизированные исключения NestJS в соответствии с проектными шаблонами, обеспечивая согласованную обработку ошибок с интеграцией BaseExceptionDto, выбором ExceptionTypeEnum и автоматическим созданием документации Swagger.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء استثناءات NestJS موحدة تتبع أنماطًا محددة للمشروع، مما يضمن معالجة أخطاء متسقة مع تكامل BaseExceptionDto، واختيار ExceptionTypeEnum، وإنشاء توثيق Swagger تلقائيًا."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating feature-specific exception classes","Creating core reusable exception types","Automating Swagger documentation for error responses","Enforcing naming conventions for exception classes"],"zh":["生成特定功能的异常类","创建核心可重用的异常类型","为错误响应自动生成 Swagger 文档","强制执行异常类的命名约定"],"ja":["機能固有の例外クラスの生成","コアとなる再利用可能な例外タイプの作成","エラーレスポンスのための Swagger ドキュメントの自動生成","例外クラスの命名規則の強制"],"ko":["기능별 예외 클래스 생성","핵심 재사용 가능한 예외 유형 생성","오류 응답을 위한 Swagger 문서 자동화","예외 클래스에 대한 명명 규칙 적용"],"es":["Generar clases de excepción específicas para funcionalidades","Crear tipos de excepción centrales reutilizables","Automatizar la documentación Swagger para respuestas de error","Imponer convenciones de nomenclatura para clases de excepción"],"fr":["Générer des classes d''exception spécifiques à une fonctionnalité","Créer des types d''exception réutilisables de base","Automatiser la documentation Swagger pour les réponses d''erreur","Appliquer des conventions de dénomination pour les classes d''exception"],"de":["Generieren von funktionsspezifischen Exception-Klassen","Erstellen von zentralen, wiederverwendbaren Exception-Typen","Automatisieren der Swagger-Dokumentation für Fehlerantworten","Durchsetzen von Namenskonventionen für Exception-Klassen"],"pt":["Geração de classes de exceção específicas para funcionalidades","Criação de tipos de exceção reutilizáveis principais","Automação da documentação Swagger para respostas de erro","Imposição de convenções de nomenclatura para classes de exceção"],"ru":["Генерация классов исключений для конкретных функций","Создание основных переиспользуемых типов исключений","Автоматизация документации Swagger для ответов об ошибках","Применение соглашений об именовании для классов исключений"],"ar":["إنشاء فئات استثناء خاصة بالميزات","إنشاء أنواع استثناء أساسية قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","أتمتة توثيق Swagger لاستجابات الأخطاء","فرض اصطلاحات التسمية لفئات الاستثناء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing NestJS project structure","Depends on BaseExceptionDto and ExceptionTypeEnum being available","Limited to NestJS framework conventions"],"zh":["需要现有的 NestJS 项目结构","依赖于 BaseExceptionDto 和 ExceptionTypeEnum 的可用性","仅限于 NestJS 框架的约定"],"ja":["既存の NestJS プロジェクト構造が必要","BaseExceptionDto および ExceptionTypeEnum の利用可能性に依存","NestJS フレームワークの規則に限定される"],"ko":["기존 NestJS 프로젝트 구조 필요","BaseExceptionDto 및 ExceptionTypeEnum 사용 가능 여부에 따라 달라짐","NestJS 프레임워크 규약으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una estructura de proyecto NestJS existente","Depende de que BaseExceptionDto y ExceptionTypeEnum estén disponibles","Limitado a las convenciones del framework NestJS"],"fr":["Nécessite une structure de projet NestJS existante","Dépend de la disponibilité de BaseExceptionDto et ExceptionTypeEnum","Limité aux conventions du framework NestJS"],"de":["Erfordert eine bestehende NestJS-Projektstruktur","Ist von der Verfügbarkeit von BaseExceptionDto und ExceptionTypeEnum abhängig","Beschränkt auf die Konventionen des NestJS-Frameworks"],"pt":["Requer uma estrutura de projeto NestJS existente","Depende da disponibilidade do BaseExceptionDto e do ExceptionTypeEnum","Limitado às convenções do framework NestJS"],"ru":["Требует существующей структуры проекта NestJS","Зависит от доступности BaseExceptionDto и ExceptionTypeEnum","Ограничено соглашениями фреймворка NestJS"],"ar":["يتطلب بنية مشروع NestJS موجودة","يعتمد على توفر BaseExceptionDto و ExceptionTypeEnum","مقيد باصطلاحات إطار عمل NestJS"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"54180e0d6ce602c2e8cd23d8234c2b1840abdad7342749c243eb79f30ffa4eee","qualityScore":41}');
DELETE FROM skills_fts WHERE id = 'sharifli4/nestjs-infra-template/create-nestjs-exception';
INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('sharifli4/nestjs-infra-template/create-nestjs-exception', 'create-nestjs-exception', 'sharifli4', 'nestjs-infra-template', 'community', 'create-nestjs-exception sharifli4 nestjs-infra-template community The create-nestjs-exception skill helps developers create standardized exceptions in NestJS projects, following best practices for error handling and documentation. NestJS 异常创建模板提供了一种快速创建标准化异常的方式，通过遵循特定的模式和命名约定 NestJS 例外作成テンプレートは、特定のパターンと命名規約に従って標準化された例外を作成するための迅速な方法を提供します NestJS 예외 생성 템플릿은 특정 패턴과 명명 규칙을 따라 표준화된 예외를 빠르게 생성하는 방법을 제공합니다 Crea excepciones personalizadas en NestJS siguiendo patrones de proyecto y mejores prácticas, incluyendo el uso de BaseExceptionDto y ExceptionTypeEnum Créez des exceptions personnalisées dans NestJS en suivant les modèles de projet et les meilleures pratiques, y compris l''utilisation de BaseExceptionDto et ExceptionTypeEnum Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Ausnahmen in NestJS, indem Sie Projektmustern und Best Practices folgen, einschließlich der Verwendung von BaseExceptionDto und ExceptionTypeEnum O Create NestJS Exception é um modelo de projeto para criar exceções padrão em NestJS, incluindo NotFoundException e CustomBadRequestException. Create NestJS Exception - это шаблон проекта для создания стандартизированных исключений в NestJS, включая NotFoundException и CustomBadRequestException для ИИ Агентов. إنشاء استثناءات NestJS هو قالب مشروع لإنشاء استثناءات معيارية في NestJS، بما في ذلك NotFoundException و CustomBadRequestException لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي. how to use create-nestjs-exception create-nestjs-exception setup guide NestJS exception handling best practices create-nestjs-exception vs custom exception handling install create-nestjs-exception what is create-nestjs-exception create-nestjs-exception alternative create-nestjs-exception tutorial NestJS project starter template standardized exception handling in NestJS NestJS 异常创建 AIエージェント 标准化异常 异常处理 错误处理 NestJS 开发 后端开发 Node.js Creates exceptions following the {Concept}{Action}Exception naming convention Utilizes BaseExceptionDto for standardized exception handling Allows selection from available ExceptionTypeEnum types Supports addition of Swagger documentation for exceptions Enables reuse of core exceptions like NotFoundException and CustomBadRequestException Determines exception location, whether feature-specific or core/reusable create-nestjs-exception is a NestJS project starter template for creating standardized exceptions, following specific patterns and guidelines.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('IPNL-POLYU/IPIN-Examples/bug-triage-evidence', 'community', 'IPNL-POLYU', 'IPIN-Examples', 'IPNL-POLYU/IPIN-Examples', 'bug-triage-evidence', 0, 0, 41, '2026-03-08T01:57:15.507Z', '2026-03-08T02:10:22.601Z', '9543b78158c0062f7e13d0a969ad97df11da07adb40b2e2553d550856e640af2', '{"id":"IPNL-POLYU/IPIN-Examples/bug-triage-evidence","name":"bug-triage-evidence","description":{"en":"The bug-triage-evidence skill helps engineers reproduce and report bugs efficiently. It assists in creating bug bundles with minimal reproduction steps and expected vs actual behavior.","zh":"Bug Triage & Evidence Packaging 是一个用于优化调试流程的工具，通过创建 bug 报告和证据包来简化错误诊断","ja":"バグ トリアージ & エビデンス パッケージは、デバッグ プロセスを最適化するためのツールで、バグ レポートと証拠パッケージを作成してエラー診断を簡素化します","ko":"버그 트라이어지 & 증거 패키징은 디버깅 프로세스를 최적화하는 도구로 버그 보고서와 증거 패키지를 생성하여 오류 진단을 간소화합니다","es":"Bug-triage-evidence es una habilidad para identificar y documentar errores de manera efectiva, utilizando técnicas de reproducción y creación de informes detallados","fr":"Bug-triage-evidence est une compétence pour identifier et documenter les erreurs de manière efficace, en utilisant des techniques de reproduction et de création de rapports détaillés","de":"Bug-triage-evidence ist eine Fähigkeit, um Fehler effektiv zu identifizieren und zu dokumentieren, indem reproduzierbare Schritte und detaillierte Berichte erstellt werden","pt":"O Bug-Triage-Evidence é uma ferramenta para ajudar desenvolvedores a identificar e relatar erros de forma eficaz, com recursos como reprodução de erros e criação de pacotes de evidências.","ru":"Bug-Triage-Evidence - это инструмент, помогающий разработчикам выявлять и отчетать об ошибках эффективно, с функциями như воспроизведение ошибок и создание пакетов доказательств.","ar":"أداة فحص الخلل Bug-Triage-Evidence هي أداة لمساعدة المطورين على تحديد الأخطاء وتقديم تقارير دقيقة، مع ميزات مثل إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء وإنشاء حزم الأدلة."},"seo":{"title":{"en":"bug-triage-evidence: Bug Reporting Setup Guide | AI Agent...","zh":"Bug Triage & Evidence Packaging Setup Guide","ja":"バグ トリアージ & エビデンス パッケージのベスト プラクティス - AIエージェント","ko":"버그 트라이어지 & 증거 패키징 설정 가이드 - AI 툴","es":"Guía de configuración para bug-triage-evidence: Informes ...","fr":"Guide de mise en place pour bug-triage-evidence : Rapport...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für bug-triage-evidence: Detaillier...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Bug-Triage-Evidence para Desenvol...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Руководство по Настройке Bug-Triage-Evidence","ar":"دليل إعداد أداة فحص الخلل Bug-Triage-Evidence"},"description":{"en":"Streamline bug reporting with bug-triage-evidence. Learn how to reproduce issues, create bug bundles, and hand off clear reports to engineers. Get started now!","zh":"使用 Bug Triage & Evidence Packaging 优化调试流程，减少手动错误，提高开发效率","ja":"バグ トリアージ & エビデンス パッケージを使用してデバッグ プロセスを最適化し、手動エラーを減らし、開発効率を向上させる","ko":"버그 트라이어지 & 증거 패키징을 사용하여 디버깅 프로세스를 최적화하고 수동 오류를 줄이고 개발 효율성을 향상시키는 방법","es":"Aprende a utilizar bug-triage-evidence para identificar y documentar errores de manera efectiva con AI Agent y mejorar la colaboración entre ingenieros","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser bug-triage-evidence pour identifier et documenter les erreurs de manière efficace avec Outil IA et améliorer la collaboration entr...","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie bug-triage-evidence verwenden, um Fehler effektiv zu identifizieren und zu dokumentieren mit KI-Tool und die Zusammenarbeit zwischen In...","pt":"Aprenda a utilizar o Bug-Triage-Evidence para identificar e relatar erros de forma eficaz, com dicas práticas para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Откройте для себя, как использовать Bug-Triage-Evidence для выявления и отчета об ошибках, с практическими советами для разработчиков.","ar":"تعرف على كيفية استخدام أداة فحص الخلل Bug-Triage-Evidence لتحديد الأخطاء وتقديم تقارير دقيقة، مع نصائح عملية للمطورين."},"definition":{"en":"bug-triage-evidence is a skill that facilitates bug triage and evidence packaging for engineers, enabling them to reproduce and report issues effectively.","zh":"Bug Triage & Evidence Packaging 是一种用于简化错误诊断和调试的技术","ja":"バグ トリアージ & エビデンス パッケージは、エラー診断とデバッグを簡素化する技術です","ko":"버그 트라이어지 & 증거 패키징은 오류 진단과 디버깅을 간소화하는 기술입니다","es":"Bug-triage-evidence es una técnica de depuración que implica la creación de un paquete de evidencia para errores, incluyendo pasos de reproducción y comportamiento esperado","fr":"Bug-triage-evidence est une technique de débogage qui consiste à créer un paquet d''évidence pour les erreurs, incluant les étapes de reproduction et le comportement attendu","de":"Bug-triage-evidence ist eine Fehlersuche-Technik, die die Erstellung eines Beweis-Pakets für Fehler beinhaltet, einschließlich reproduzierbarer Schritte und erwartetem Verhalten","pt":"O Bug-Triage-Evidence é uma técnica de depuração que envolve a reprodução e documentação de erros para facilitar a resolução.","ru":"Bug-Triage-Evidence - это техника отладки, включающая воспроизведение и документирование ошибок для облегчения решения.","ar":"أداة فحص الخلل Bug-Triage-Evidence هي تقنية فحص تشمل إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء وتوثيقها لتسهيل الحل."},"features":{"en":["Reproduces issues with minimal steps and command-line entries","Captures expected vs actual behavior in 1-3 bullet points","Creates bug bundles in `.dev/` folders with README.md files","Includes seed information for reproducibility","Supports clear bug reporting with symlinks and folder structures"],"zh":["创建 bug 报告和证据包","简化错误诊断和调试","支持命令行和脚本入口","可以捕获预期和实际行为"],"ja":["バグ レポートと証拠パッケージの作成","エラー診断とデバッグの簡素化","コマンドラインとスクリプト入口のサポート","予想と実際の動作のキャプチャ"],"ko":["버그 보고서와 증거 패키지 생성","오류 진단과 디버깅을 간소화","명령줄과 스크립트入口 지원","예상과 실제 동작의 캡처"],"es":["Reproducción de errores con pasos mínimos","Creación de un paquete de evidencia en `.dev/`","Inclusión de un archivo `README.md` con información detallada","Captura de comportamiento esperado vs real","Uso de técnicas de depuración para identificar errores"],"fr":["Reproduction d''erreurs avec des étapes minimales","Création d''un paquet d''évidence dans `.dev/`","Inclusion d''un fichier `README.md` avec des informations détaillées","Capture du comportement attendu vs réel","Utilisation de techniques de débogage pour identifier les erreurs"],"de":["Reproduktion von Fehlern mit minimalen Schritten","Erstellung eines Beweis-Pakets in `.dev/`","Einclusion einer Datei `README.md` mit detaillierten Informationen","Erfassung des erwarteten Verhaltens vs tatsächlichem Verhalten","Verwendung von Fehlersuche-Techniken zur Identifizierung von Fehlern"],"pt":["Reprodução de erros minimamente","Criação de pacotes de evidências em `.dev/`","Documentação de comportamento esperado vs real","Uso de seed para reproduzir erros aleatórios","Criação de uma pasta para armazenar evidências de erros"],"ru":["Минимальное воспроизведение ошибок","Создание пакетов доказательств в `.dev/`","Документирование ожидаемого и фактического поведения","Использование seed для воспроизведения случайных ошибок","Создание папки для хранения доказательств ошибок"],"ar":["إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء بطريقة мінімي","إنشاء حزم الأدلة في `.dev/`","توثيق السلوك المتوقع مقابل السلوك الفعلي","استخدام البذور لإعادة إنتاج الأخطاء العشوائية","إنشاء مجلد لتخزين أدلة الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use bug-triage-evidence","bug-triage-evidence setup guide","bug reporting best practices","bug-triage-evidence alternative","bug-triage-evidence vs debug-diary","bug-triage-evidence install","what is bug-triage-evidence","bug-triage-evidence tutorial","bug-triage-evidence for AI agents"],"zh":["Bug Triage & Evidence Packaging","调试工具","错误诊断","AI工具","开发效率","命令行工具"],"ja":["バグ トリアージ & エビデンス パッケージ","デバッグ ツール","エラー診断","AIエージェント","開発効率","コマンドライン ツール"],"ko":["버그 트라이어지 & 증거 패키징","디버깅 도구","오류 진단","AI 툴","개발 효율성","명령줄 도구"],"es":["bug-triage-evidence","AI Agent","informes de errores","depuración de código","colaboración entre ingenieros","identificación de errores","documentación de errores","técnicas de reproducción"],"fr":["bug-triage-evidence","Outil IA","rapports de bogue","débogage de code","collaboration entre ingénieurs","identification d''erreurs","documentation d''erreurs","techniques de reproduction"],"de":["bug-triage-evidence","KI-Tool","Fehlerberichte","Fehlersuche","Zusammenarbeit zwischen Ingenieuren","Fehleridentifizierung","Fehlerdokumentation","Reproduktionstechniken"],"pt":["bug triage","evidence packaging","desenvolvimento de software","depuração de erros","relatório de erros","reprodução de erros","criação de pacotes de evidências","documentação de erros"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","bug triage","пакетирование доказательств","разработка программного обеспечения","отладка ошибок","отчет об ошибках","воспроизведение ошибок","создание пакетов доказательств","документирование ошибок"],"ar":["أداة فحص الخلل","bug triage","تحليل الأخطاء","تطوير البرمجيات","فحص الأخطاء","تقديم تقارير الأخطاء","إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء","إنشاء حزم الأدلة","توثيق الأخطاء"]}},"owner":"IPNL-POLYU","repo":"IPIN-Examples","repoPath":"IPNL-POLYU/IPIN-Examples","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.507Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bug-triage-evidence","description":"Triage bugs and package reproducible evidence cleanly (.dev artifacts, chapter figures, and README updates). Use when fixing a bug or mismatch vs expected results.","bodyPreview":"# Bug triage & evidence packaging\n\nUse this skill when:\n- A simulation result looks wrong, plots mismatch expected figures, or a test fails.\n- You need to hand off a clear bug report to another engineer.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) **Reproduce**\n- Write the minimal reproduction steps (command, script entrypoint, seed if relevant).\n- Capture expected vs actual behavior in 1–3 bullets.\n\n2) **Create a bug bundle in `.dev/`**\nCreate a folder:\n- `.dev/bug-<short-slug>/`\nInclude:\n- `README.md` containing:\n  - sy","body":"# Bug triage & evidence packaging\n\nUse this skill when:\n- A simulation result looks wrong, plots mismatch expected figures, or a test fails.\n- You need to hand off a clear bug report to another engineer.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) **Reproduce**\n- Write the minimal reproduction steps (command, script entrypoint, seed if relevant).\n- Capture expected vs actual behavior in 1–3 bullets.\n\n2) **Create a bug bundle in `.dev/`**\nCreate a folder:\n- `.dev/bug-<short-slug>/`\nInclude:\n- `README.md` containing:\n  - symptoms\n  - reproduction steps\n  - expected vs actual\n  - suspected root cause (if any)\n  - fix summary + verification steps\n- Any logs / short diffs / notes needed to validate.\n\n3) **Figures**\n- If the bug is chapter-specific: save plots in `chX_*/figs/`\n- If it''s general debugging evidence: also copy or link into `.dev/bug-<slug>/`\n\n4) **Update chapter README when relevant**\nIf the bug affects a `chX_*/README.md`:\n- Add a short student-centric note:\n  - what was wrong\n  - what was fixed\n  - how to run the corrected example\n  - reference the figure files you saved in `chX_*/figs/`\n\n5) **Verification**\n- Add/adjust tests under `tests/` to prevent regression.\n- Re-run the minimal reproduction + full test suite if reasonable.\n\n## Output standard\nA reviewer should be able to:\n- reproduce in <5 minutes\n- see the mismatch in one figure\n- see the fix rationale in one page\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:22.601Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing efficient bug reproduction and reporting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的错误复现和报告功能的调试代理。","ja":"デバッグエージェントが効率的なバグ再現と報告機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 버그 재현 및 보고 기능이 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración que necesitan capacidades de reproducción y generación de informes de errores eficientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de débogage ayant besoin de capacités de reproduction et de génération de rapports de bogue efficaces.","de":"Perfekt für Debugging-Agents, die effiziente Fehlernachstellung und Berichterstellungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Depuração que necessitam de reprodução e relatórios de bugs eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов отладки, требующих эффективного воспроизведения и отчетности ошибках.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تصحيح الأخطاء الذي يحتاج إلى إعادة إنتاج أخطاء فعالة وملفات تقرير"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive bug bundles with minimal reproduction steps and expected vs actual behavior, utilizing Markdown files like README.md and organized folder structures like .dev/bug-<short-slug>/","zh":"赋予代理创建综合的错误包的能力，需要最少的复现步骤和预期与实际行为，并利用Markdown文件，如README.md和组织的文件夹结构，如.dev/bug-<short-slug>/","ja":"エージェントが包括的なバグバンドルを作成できるようにし、再現する手順と期待される動作と実際の動作を最小限に抑え、Markdownファイル（例：README.md）や.dev/bug-<short-slug>/のような整理されたフォルダ構造を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 최소한의 재현 단계와 예상 대 실제 동작을 사용하여 포괄적인 버그 번들을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, README.md와 같은 Markdown 파일 및 .dev/bug-<short-slug>/와 같은 구성된 폴더 구조를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear paquetes de errores integrales con pasos de reproducción mínimos y comportamiento esperado frente a comportamiento real, utilizando archivos Markdown como README.md y estructuras de carpetas organizadas como .dev/bug-<short-slug>/","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des bundles de bogues complets avec des étapes de reproduction minimales et un comportement attendu vs réel, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown comme README.md et des structures de dossiers organisées comme .dev/bug-<short-slug>/","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Fehlerpakete mit minimalen Reproduktionsschritten und erwartetem vs. tatsächlichem Verhalten zu erstellen, indem Markdown-Dateien wie README.md und organisierte Ordnerstrukturen wie .dev/bug-<short-slug>/ verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar pacotes de bugs abrangentes com etapas mínimas de reprodução e comportamento esperado vs real, utilizando arquivos Markdown como README.md e estruturas de pastas organizadas como .dev/bug-<short-slug>/","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать полные пакеты ошибок с минимальными шагами воспроизведения и ожидаемым против фактического поведения, используя файлы Markdown, такие как README.md и организованные структуры папок, такие как .dev/bug-<short-slug>/","ar":"تمكين العميل من إنشاء حزم شاملة للأخطاء مع خطوات إعادة إنتاج mínimas وسلوك متوقع مقابل حقيقي ، باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل README.md وهياكل مجلدات منظمة مثل .dev/bug-<short-slug>/"},"useCases":{"en":["Reproducing failed tests","Generating bug reports with expected vs actual behavior","Creating minimal reproduction steps for handoff to other engineers"],"zh":["再现失败的测试","生成预期与实际行为的错误报告","创建最小的再现步骤以交付给其他工程师"],"ja":["失敗したテストの再現","期待される動作と実際の動作のバグレポートを生成","他のエンジニアに引き継ぐための最小の再現手順を作成"],"ko":["실패한 테스트의 재현","예상 대 실제 동작의 버그 보고서 생성","다른 엔지니어에게 전달하기 위한 최소한의 재현 단계 생성"],"es":["Reproducir pruebas fallidas","Generar informes de errores con comportamiento esperado frente a comportamiento real","Crear pasos de reproducción mínimos para la transferencia a otros ingenieros"],"fr":["Reproduire des tests échoués","Générer des rapports de bogues avec un comportement attendu vs réel","Créer des étapes de reproduction minimales pour le transfert à d''autres ingénieurs"],"de":["Fehlschlagene Tests reproduzieren","Fehlerberichte mit erwartetem vs. tatsächlichem Verhalten generieren","Minimale Reproduktionsschritte für die Übergabe an andere Ingenieure erstellen"],"pt":["Reproduzir testes com falha","Gerar relatórios de bugs com comportamento esperado vs real","Criar etapas mínimas de reprodução para entrega a outros engenheiros"],"ru":["Воспроизводить неудавшиеся тесты","Генерировать отчеты об ошибках с ожидаемым против фактического поведения","Создавать минимальные шаги воспроизведения для передачи другим инженерам"],"ar":["إعادة إنتاج الاختبارات الفاشلة","توليد تقارير الأخطاء مع السلوك المتوقع مقابل الواقعي","إنشاء خطوات إعادة إنتاج mínimas للتسليم إلى مهندسين آخرين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access for creating bug bundles","Assumes familiarity with Markdown formatting for README.md files"],"zh":["创建错误包需要文件系统访问","假设熟悉Markdown格式用于README.md文件"],"ja":["バグバンドルの作成にはファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","README.mdファイルでMarkdown形式を使用するための事前知識が必要"],"ko":["버그 번들을 생성하려면 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요합니다.","README.md 파일에서 Markdown 형식을 사용하는 데 익숙하다고 가정합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para crear paquetes de errores","Supone familiaridad con la formación de Markdown para archivos README.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour créer des bundles de bogues","Suppose une familiarité avec la mise en forme Markdown pour les fichiers README.md"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem, um Fehlerpakete zu erstellen","Geht von Vertrautheit mit der Markdown-Formatierung für README.md-Dateien aus"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao sistema de arquivos para criar pacotes de bugs","Pressupõe familiaridade com formatação Markdown para arquivos README.md"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для создания пакетов ошибок","Предполагает знакомство с форматированием Markdown для файлов README.md"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لإنشاء حزم الأخطاء","يفترض دراية بالتنسيق Markdown لملفات README.md"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"9543b78158c0062f7e13d0a969ad97df11da07adb40b2e2553d550856e640af2","qualityScore":41}');
