INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('QuixiAI/Hexis/email-digest', 'email-digest', 'QuixiAI', 'Hexis', 'community', 'email-digest QuixiAI Hexis community The email-digest skill processes incoming emails into structured memories, extracting action items and surfacing threads that need attention, benefiting AI agents and developers. Email Digest AIエージェント可以处理和摘要电子邮件，提取重要信息 Email Digest AIエージェントはメールを処理し、重要な情報を抽出する Email Digest AI 에이전트는 이메일을 처리하고 요약하여 중요한 정보를 제공 Email-digest es un flujo de trabajo que procesa correos electrónicos entrantes en memorias estructuradas, extrae elementos de acción y resalta hilos que requieren atención. Email-digest est un workflow qui traite les emails entrants en mémoires structurées, extrait les éléments d''action et met en avant les threads qui nécessitent une attention. Email-Digest ist ein Workflow, der eingehende E-Mails in strukturierte Erinnerungen verarbeitet, Aktionselemente extrahiert und Threads hervorhebt, die Aufmerksamkeit erfordern. O email-digest é um fluxo de trabalho que processa e-mails e extrai itens de ação importantes ИИ Агент email-digest представляет собой рабочий процесс, который обрабатывает входящие электронные письма и извлекает важные действия البريد الإلكتروني للتلبية هو عملية工作 لمعالجة البريد الوارد واستخراج عناصر العمل المهمة how to use email-digest email-digest setup guide email-digest alternative automated email workflow email-digest vs mailparser what is email-digest email-digest install email processing automation Email Digest AIエージェント 电子邮件处理 电子邮件摘要 AIエージェント技术 recall autonomous heartbeats daily briefing Processes incoming emails into structured memories using recall Extracts action items from emails for prioritized attention Surfaces threads that need attention based on recency and importance Integrates with autonomous heartbeats to check for new mail Supports daily briefing generation with email highlights Uses step-by-step methodology for efficient email workflow management email-digest is a workflow process that automates email processing, using recall to check for new mail and extract relevant information.');
